<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Ngsäea Khut</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngsäea KHUT</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngsäea Khut</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ngs</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngsäea</para>
  <para style="mt1">KHUT</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngsäea khutbi cun Luhka naw a yuka Thangkdawa msapnaka kyaki. Hin üng aktunga a pyen hlünak cun, Jesuha axüisaw kcüke naw, Ngmüimkhya Ngcima lam msümnak am, Jerusalem, Judah khaw, Samarih khaw ja khawmdeka adütnak vei cäpa Thangkdaw ami pyena amawnga kyaki (1:8). Ngsäea khutbi üng a yuka Khritjana khutbi cun, Judah khyange üng tünei lü khawmdek khan avan naw ami jum lawa mawnga kyaki. Ca yukia a pyen hlü ta, Khritjane naw Romah khyawngpe tu khaiea am akyanak ja, Khritjan jumnak naw Judahea jumnak akümbesaka mawng cun, ca khekie naw ami ksing vaia phäha a yuknaka kyaki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jesuha mawng Thangkdaw ami pyen law ja Khritjan Sangcim ami mdüi lawa mawng cun, kthuma mtai lü mdanki: (1) Jesuh khankhawa a kai be käna Jerusalema Khritjan angtüi lawa mawng; (2) Palestin khaw avang üng a pha lawa mawng; (3) Romah khaw üng khüt khaia Mediterranean khaw avan üng a pha lawa mawnga kyakie.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngsäea khutbi üng aktung bawka a mawng mat cun, Jerusalema Pentikos mhnüp üng, jumki khyange kthayüi ja pe lawkia Ngmüimkhya Ngcima khutbia mawnga kyaki. Acuna Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw sangcim ja Khritjan ngvaie cun kthayüi ja pe lü lam a ja msüma mawng pi mdangki. Khritjan thangkdawa aphung cun hin üng vekia ami ngthupyenea kyaki. Jumkiea xünnak ja khritjan sang hea mlungkaw matnak naw thangkdawa hlüngtainak ami mdanga mawng pi ngdang khaia yuka kyaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Bawi Jesuh amawng ksingpüi vaia ami ngtüneinak (1:1-26)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Jesuha ak’hnu säiha ngthumkhän ja khyütam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Judah Iskarota nghnün üng xünak be (1:15-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem üng ksingpüia mawng (2:1—8:3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah ja Samarih hne üng ksingpüia ami kya amawng (8:4—12:25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawluha khutbi (13:1—28:31)</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Mhnama khutbi khaia a cehnak kcük (13:1—14:28)</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Jerusalema ami bia konfaren (15:1-35)</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Mhnama khutbi khaia a ceh anghngihnak (15:36—18:22)</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Mhnama khutbi khaia a ceh akthumnak (18:23—21:16)</para>
  <para style="io2">he. Jerusalem, Caesarea ja Romah khawa Pawluh thawngim üng a khyuma mawng (21:17—28:31)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Lk 1:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Theophiluh aw: Ka yuk kcüka cauk cun Jesuh naw jah mtheimthang lü khut a pawh lawnak üng tünei lü, <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>khankhawa a kai be vei cäpa ania mawnglama kyaki. Ani cun naw khankhawa am a kai be ham üng, a xüa Ngsäe cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcima johit am lam jah msüm hütki. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Ani cun a thih käna mhnüp kphyükipa k'um üng Ngsäea veia khawvei ngdang be lü a xün bea mawng cun akcanga mdang hütki. Ngsäe naw ani cun hmukie, ani naw pi Pamhnama pea mawng jah mthehki. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Lk 24:49</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Ngsäe jah ngbämsaki naw,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Atänga ami law üng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ani cun amimi üng a ve k'um üng,</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ani cun amimi üng atänga a ei üng.</char></note> “Jerusalem käh cehta u lü, ka Paa khyütam, nami ngjaka ka pyen khawi cän ana k'äih ua. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mk 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Lk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Jn 1:33</ref></char></note>Johan naw tui üng Baptican ning ja peki, khaw mhnüp am hjo lü Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üng Baptican nami kham khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh khana kai beki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Acunüng, amimi cun, atänga ngkhäm law u lü, “Bawipa aw, atuha Isarele üng pe na jah pet khai aw?” ti u lü, ami kthäh. <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, “Akcün ja ahnün cun ka Pa naw amäta themnak üng a cenga kyase, nangmi naw nami ksing vaia am kya ve. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mt 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mk 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Lk 24:47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref></char></note>Acunsepi, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim nami khana a pha law üng, johit am nami be law khai. Acunüng, Jerusalem mlüh, Judah, Samarih ja khawmdeka adütnak cäpa, kei a saksia nami kya khai” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Lk 24:50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note>Acuna ngthu a pyen law päng üng, ami hmuh mahmaha khana kai be se, khawngmei naw am ami hmuh be thei vaia a thupin. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>A hang kai be üng axüisawe naw khankhawa han bük kyetkie. Acunüng, khyang nghngih suisak abawk jah suisa ni lü, ami peia ngdüi lawki xawi. <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>Acu xawi naw, “Kalile khyange aw, ise khankhawa hang mang u lü, nami ngdüikie ni? Hina Jesuh hin nami vei üngkhyüh nami hmuha khana a kaia mäiha, law be khai” ani ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Iskarota hnün</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Acunüng, Ngsäe cun Olip mcung ami ti üngka naw Jerusalem mlüha cit bekie. Acuna mcung cun Jerusalem mlüh üngkhyüh kilometer mat banga thuki. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mt 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mk 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Lk 6:14-16</ref></char></note>Amimi cun mlüha pha be u lü, ami im kainaka k'uma lutkie: acune cun, Pita, Johan, Jakuk, Andru, Philip, Thomah, Batolame, Mahte, Alaphaha cakpa Jakuk, Sihmon Zelot ja Jakuka cakpa Judaha kyakie. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Amimi cun, Jesuha nu Marih ja akce nghnumie ni, Jesuha a nae am, atänga ngkhäm u lü ktaiyü läkie. <verse eid="ACT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Acunüng, angawi tiktuh üng, jumkia khyange ami ngkhäa phya ja mku cun ngkhäm lawki he. Pita naw ami nglunga ngdüi law lü, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>“Ka benae aw, Jesuh man khaie üng, lam ja msümkia, Judah Iskarota mawng Cangcim üng veki cun küm päng ve. Acuna Cangcim cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw Davit üngkhyüha a pyena kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Judah cun axüisaw mata kyase, khut mi binak üng pi ngpüi vaia a xüa kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18,19:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mt 27:3-8</ref></char></note>Ani cun am daw khaia ngui yah lü khaw hnün mat khyäiki, acunüng kya law lü ta a khawn pawk lü, a khyü avan lut law päihki. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Acuna mawng cun Jerusalema vekia khyang avan naw ngja u lü, acuna khaw hnün cun, amimäta ngthu am, ‘Akeldama ami sui, acun cun, ‘Thisen Hnün’ tinaka kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: a</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Sal 69:25</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Sal 109:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Salan caup üng, ‘A im xawngei lü, ak'uma u am ve se,’ ti lü ng’yuki, acuna thea ng’yuk betüki ta, ‘khyang kce naw ania hnün bi se’ a ti. <verse eid="ACT 1:20"/><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21-22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mt 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mk 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Lk 3:21</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Lk 24:51</ref></char></note>“Acunakyase, Johan naw Baptican<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21-22:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Johan naw bapticana mawng sangki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Johan naw ani baptican peki.</char></note> a ja petnak üng tün lü, Jesuh khana a kai be cäpa, mi veia citcawn hü lü vekie üngka, Bawipa Jesuha a thawhnak be saksi na lü jah sang püi khaia khyang mat mi mcawn be khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Acunüng, ani cun khyang nghngih üngka mat xü vaia mkyäpkie. Acun xawi ta Josep: Barsaba ami tia Jastas ja Matthias kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Acunüng, amimi ktaiyü u lü, “Bawipa, khyanga mlung avan na ksingki, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>a venak vaia cit pängki Judaha hnün üng ngsä khut bi khaia hin xawi üngka u na xüki, jah mtheha” ami ti. <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Acunüng, cung kphawng u lü, Matthias naw cung yah se, ani cun ngsä xaleiate am atänga khutbi hnga khaia mcawnkie.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya Ngcima phalawnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:9-11">Deut 6:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Pentikos mhnüp a pha law üng, jumeikia khyang avan cun atänga hnün at üng ngkhämkie. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Acunüng, khankhaw üngkhyüh naw, angxita, khawkhia mäiha ng'yüngki cun ami venaka im üng pha law lü be lawki. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Acunüng mleie cun meia mäiha däi lü mat cim üng pek se ami hmuh u. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Ami van cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be u se, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw a jah ngthuheisaka mäiha, ngthu kce am ngthuei lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Acunüng, khankhawa ke khawmdek khan, khyawngpe naküt üngka naw lawki he jumeikia Judahe cun Jerusalem mlüha vekie. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Acuna ng'yüng ami ngjak ja, khyange ngkhäm lawki he. Axüsawea ngthu pyen cun khyang naküt naw amimäta ngthu a phäh phäh üng ngjak u lü, cäieikie. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Acunüng, ami ngkhä cäica law u lü, “Hina ngthu pyenkie cen Kalile khyangea am kya u bä! <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Ise hina ami ngthu pyen cän mi van naw mi khyü phäh phäh üng mi ksing thei ni? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Mimi cun avang Pontas khaw, Medih khaw, ja Elam khawa kae; avang cun Mesopotemih khaw, Judah khaw, ja Kappadokih khawa kae; avang cun Pontuh khaw ja Asah khawa kae, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>avang cun Pharikih khaw ja Pampulih khawa kae, avang cun Egypt khaw, ja Kurinih khaw peia Lihbuh khawa kaea mi kyaki. Avang he cun Romah khaw üngka naw kdung lawki hea Judahe ja Judah thum üng ngkhawkia Khyangmjükcea mi kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Avang cun Karete khaw ja Arab khaw ja Judah khawa kaea mi kyaki. Cunsepi Pamhnam hlüngtaikia khutbi cun pyen u se, mimäta ngthu phäh phäh üng mi ngjaki ni” ami ti. <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Amimi cun aktäa cäica u lü, “Hin hin ia suilam ni?” ti u lü ngthähki he.<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Acunüngpi khyang kcee naw, “Hina khyange hin mpyüi lawki he ni” ti u lü jah yaiheikie.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitaa ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Acunüng, Pita cun a püi xaleiatea ksunga ngdüi law lü, angsanga, “Judah üngka khyange ja, Jerusalem mlüha nami vekia khyange aw, nami van naw na ngai ua, hina asuilam cun ka ning jah mtheh khai. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Hina khyange cun nami ngaiha mäiha, am mpyüi u, tuh cun ngawilam naji kaw ni a law ham ve. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Hin cun sahma Jolah naw ana pyen khawia mawng ni:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Jol 2:28-32</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>‘Pamhnam naw, akpäihnaka khaw mhnüpe üng, hikba ka pawh law khai, khyang naküta khana ka Ngmüimkhya ka bui law khai. Nami cakpae ja nami canglae naw ka ngthu sang khaie; cawngpyange naw Pamhnama mdan hmu law khaie, axü ngvaie müngmang mah khaie.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Acuna khaw mhnüpe üng, ka mpyae nghnumi kpami avana khana ka Ngmüimkhya ka bui khai, amimi naw ka ngthu sang khaie.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Khana vekia khankhawa cäica phyaki he ja, mcea vekia mdek khana kyühkyawk phyaki he ka ja mdang khai. Thisen lawng khai, mei ve law lü meikhu ngmüp khai.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Hlüngtai kyäpsawkia Bawipaa kyum lawnak vaia Mhnüp am a pha ham üng, jin mü law lü khaw nghmüp law khai, khya pi thisena thawn lü sen law khai.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Acunüng, au pi Bawipa naw a jah yung vaia khüki naküt küikyannak khai’ a ti. <verse eid="ACT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Isarel khyange aw, hina ngthue cän ngai ua, Pamhnam naw Nazaret Jesuha ana cun müncam phyaki he ja kyühkyawk phyaki he ani üng a mdang pänga kyaki. Acune cun nami veia ngdang pängkia kyase nami van naw nami ksingki. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mt 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mk 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Lk 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Jn 19:18</ref></char></note>Pamhnam naw a mlung ngaiha mäiha Jesuh cun nami kut üng ning jah mhjum pängki ni; acunüng, nangmi naw ani cun khyang ksee mah maha kutlamtung üng nami jah hnimsaki. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mt 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mk 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Lk 24:5</ref></char></note>Acunüngpi Pamhnam naw thihnak üngka, mtho be lü a lätsaka kyaki. Acunakyase thihnak naw ani cun am a man theia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Sal 16:8-11</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Ania mawng cun Davit naw pyen lü, ‘Bawipa cun am ka ve ham kcüne üng ka hmuki, ani cun ka hlawnga veki, kei üng ng’änak am ve.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Acunakyase, ka mlung jenak üng be lü ka ngthu pi jekyainak üng beki. Kei cun thi theikia pumsaa ka kya üngpi, äpeinak üng ka ngtungjin khai.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Isetiakyaküng, nang naw kei cun thihnak khawmdeka am na hawiki; sitihkia na mpya cun ng'uhnaka a thu vai am tängki.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Nang naw xünnaka lam cun na, na mhnuh päng ni, atänga na, na vepüinak naw na jekyaisak khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Ka püie, mi pupa üng ngming ngthangkia Davit sangpuxanga mawng cun angsinga ka ning jah mtheh khai ni. Ani cun thi se ami k’ut pänga kyaki, a lungdü pi tuh vei cäpa mi veia ve hamki.<verse eid="ACT 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Sal 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref></char>
    </note>Ani cun sahmaa kyase, ani naw Mhnama khyütam ksingki, Davita ngsawn üngka mat mat cun Davita kba sangpuxanga kya be khai tia Pamhnama khyütam cun ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Pamhnam naw ngawia i bi law khai ti cun Davit naw hmu lü, Mesijah a thawh be vaia mawng a pyennak üng, ‘Ani cun thihnak khawmdeka käh hawih khai, a pumsa pi ng'uhnaka käh thuei khai’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Acuna Jesuh cun Pamhnam naw thihnak üngkhyüh mtho be lü, mi van cun acuna saksia mi kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Ani cun a pa, Pamhnama khet da mhlünmtaia kyaki, a khyütama mäiha Ngmüimkhya Ngcim cun a pa veia yah lü, atuh nami hmu ngjaka a bänak cun mi khana a pha lawsaka kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34,35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sal 110:1</ref></char></note>Davit cun khankhawa am kai ham; acunsepi ani naw pyen lü, ‘Bawipa naw ka Bawipa veia: Ka khet lama ngawa,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>na yee cun na khawpha na mtainak vaia am ka jah tak hama küt üng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Acunakyase, Isarel khyange aw, nangmi naw kutlamtung üng taih u lü nami hnima Jesuh cän, Pamhnam naw Bawipa ja Mesijaha thawnsak päng ni ti cän angtea nami ksing vai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Acun ngjakia khyange cun aktäa ami mlung cäicing se, Pita ja ngsä kceea veia, “Benae aw, i kami pawh khai?” ti u lü, kthähkie. <verse eid="ACT 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Acunüng, Pita naw, “Ngjut ua, nami mkhyekat mhlätnak vaia Jesuh Khritawa ngming am Baptican khan ua; acunüng, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya Ngcim nami yah khai. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Pamhnama khyütam cun, nangmia phäh, nami caea phäh ja, akthuknaka vekiea Bawipa mi Pamhnam naw a veia a jah khü naküta phäha kyaki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Acuna thea, Pita naw ngthu khawha pyen lü, “Hina khyang ksee phäh law khaia mkhuimkhanak üngkhyüh ng’yungei ua” tia, a jah nghuinak. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Khyang khawhah naw ania ngthu pyen cun jum u lü Baptican khankie, acuna mhnüp üng khyang thawng kthum bang ngkhaw lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Acune cun, Ngsäe naw jah mthei u se, atänga ve u lü, atänga eiaw u lü, atänga ktaiyü lü vekie.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeikie ksunga ngneisak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Ngsäe naw müncam phyaki he ja kyühkyawk phyaki he khawhah ja pawh u se, khyange cun cäi päihkie. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Ngs 4:32-35</ref></char></note>Jumeikie naküt cun mlungkaw mat am ve u lü ami khawhthem he pi yetca u lü summangkie. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Amimi cun ami khawhthem he jah jawi u lü, ami yaha ngui cun hlükawki mat cim üng ami jah yet u. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Amimi cun amhnüp tä se Templea ngkhyum u lü, ami ima pi mlung nemnak ja jekyainak am atänga eiawki he. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Pamhnam mküimto u lü, khyang naküta jenak vaia vekie. Acunüng Bawipa naw küikyannak yahkie cun amhnüp tä se jah mkhaw lü amimi cun a jah nungsak.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">A khawkse mdaw bea mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Acunüng, Pita ja Johan cun mü lam naji kthum üng ktaiyü khaia ktaiyünaka kcün üng Templea citki xawi. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Khyang mat a hmi law üng tün lü xoki ami kaw law. Temple k'uma lutkiea veia kthähei khaia, mkawt ngto ami tia peia, amhnüp tä se ami vesak; <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Acun naw Pita ja Johan Temple k'uma lut hlüki xawi ja hmu lü, ani veia kthäheiki. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Pita ja Johan naw ani bükteng, cun üng, Pita naw, “Ja büktenga” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Acunüng, ani naw ani veia icamä yah khaia ngai lü, ja han bükteng se, <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Pita naw, “Ngui ja xüi am ta üng; acunsepi ka tak ka ning pe khai: Nazaret Jesuh Khritawa ngming üng na khaw am ngdüi lü cita” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Pita naw a khet kut man lü mtho se; acun ja angxita a khaw xawi ja a khawmike cun kthamah law bekie. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Ani cun tho law lü, ngdüi lü a khaw am citki. A khaw am cit hü lü, ju jawng hang jawng lü, Pamhnam a mhlünmtai maha Temple k'uma lut haki. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Acunüng, a khaw am cit hü lü, Pamhnam a mhlünmtai cun khyange naw hmu u lü; <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>ani cun Temple mkawt ngto ami tia peia kthähei lü ngaw khawiki tia ksing u lü; ania mawng cun aktäa cäicatnak u lü vekie.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Templea Pitaa ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>A khaw daw beki naw Pita ja Johan a jah man k'um üng, khyang naküt cun aktäa cäi u lü Solamona ngvawng mkawt ami tia hnün, ami veia dawng lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Pita naw acun a hmuh ja khyange ja msang lü, “Isarel khyange aw, hin hin ise aktäa nami cäinaki ni? Kamimäta khyaihnak ja kamimäta binak thei am ani cit thei khaia kami pawhkia mäiha i se nami ngaiki ni? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Ex 3:15</ref></char></note>Abraham, Isak ja Jakopa Pamhnam, mi pupaea Pamhnam naw, a mpya Jesuh cun mhlünmtaiki ni; ani cun nami ja mansak, Pilat naw mhlät vai a ti üngpi am nami tängki. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mt 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mk 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Lk 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Jn 19:12-15</ref></char></note>Ani cun ngcim lü dawki ni lüpi nami mahkie, Khyang ngcimcai ja khyang ngsungpyun am ngai u lü, khyang hnimki mhlät vaia ksaia Pilat nami kthähki. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Xünnaka Bawi cun nami hnimki; acunsepi Pamhnam naw thihnak üngka a mthawh be ni; acun saksia kami kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Jesuha ngming naw ni hina akxo cen kyanak a pet ve. Nami hmu ja nami ksing hin Jesuha ngming jumnak ka phäha ni akya ve. Tuhkbäih nami hmu thei hin Jesuh üng jumeinaka phäha ni akya ve.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>Acunsepi, ka benae aw, nami ngvaie naw am ami hnaläüa phäha ami pawha mäiha, nami naw pi am ami hnaläü ka ksingki. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Acunsepi Pamhnam naw sahmae naküt üng, Khritaw naw khuikhanak a khamei vaia ngthu ana pyen law cen, acukba küm lawsaki ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Acunakyase, nami mkhyekatnake ja mkhyünak vaia ngjut u lü nghlat be ua, acunüng, Bawipa naw nami mkhyekatnak ning ja mhlät khai. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Acunüng, Ngmüimkhya kyanak akcün Bawipa üngka naw pha law se, nami phäha a mcawn päng Mesijah Jesuh cän tüi law khai. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw a sahma ngcimea mpyawng üng ajana a na jah pyen lawe, avan akthaia pyannak bea kcün am a pha hama küt üng, khankhawa ani cun a veia vepüi ma khai. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Deut 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Mosi naw, ‘Bawipa nami Pamhnam naw, keia mäi sahma mat nangmi üngka ning jah tüih law pe khai;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ani naw a na tüih lawa kba; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">keia kba.</char></note> ani naw nami veia ngthu a pyen naküt cun nami ngaih pet khai; <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Deut 18:19</ref></char></note>au pi, acuna sahma a ngthu käh ngaiki naküt cun, Pamhnama khyang üngka naw mkhya lü, mkhyüha kya khai’ a ti ni. <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Sahma Samuilah üng tün lü, ak’hnu säiha ngthu pyenkiea sahmae cäpa, ami van naw atuha akcüna mawng cun a na pyen khawikie. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Gen 22:18</ref></char></note>Nangmi cun Pamhnam naw nami pae am a na pyen law, sahmae ja ngthumkhäna caea nami kyaki ni; Pamhnam naw Abrahama veia, ‘Nanga ngsawn am khawmdek khyange naküt jodawnak am be khaie tia, nami pupaea veia a jah ngthumkhän. <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Pamhnam naw a Mpya cun xü lü nami veia a tüih law ma, acun naw nami mkhyenak nglata u lü jodawnak ning jah pe khaia kyaki ni” tia khyangea veia a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pita ja Johan ami jah man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Pita ja Johan naw khyangea veia ngthu ani pyen k'um üng, ktaiyüe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ktaiyüe; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üngta </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ktaiyü ngvaie.</char></note> Temple mtätki ngvaie ja, Sadukee cun ani veia pha lawki he, <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>khyang ani ja mthei ja, Jesuha phäha khyang kthi a thaw bea ngthu ani pyena phäha, ami mlung aktäa am je. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Ja man u lü, mü lama akyaa phäha, ngawi cäpa thawngim üng ami ja khyum. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Acunsepi, ngthu ngaikie jumei u lü; acune cun thawngmhma bang lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Acunüng, a ngawia, Judah mkhawnge, ami ngvaie, thum ksinge Jerusalema ngbäm lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Amimi cun ktaiyü ngvai säih Anna, Kaiphah, Johan, Aleksanda ja, ktaiyü ngvaia a pacae naküt üng nghmukie. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Pita ja Johan cun anglunga jah ngdüihsak u lü, “Ihawkba ahin nani pawh ni. Ia johit ja ua ngming nani sumei ni” ti u lü ami jah kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Pita naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be lü ami veia, “Khyanga, mkhawnge ja ngvaie aw, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>a khaw kxo mdaw be üng, ‘Hin hin ise daw law beki ni?’ tia tungawi keini nami jah kthäh üng, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>nami ngkhä naw ksing ua, Isarel khyange naküt naw pi ksing u se, Nazaret Jesuh Khritaw kutlamktung üng nami taih, Pamhnam naw thihnak üngka naw a mthawh be, ania ngming am, hin üng nami hmaia mya lü ngdüiki. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sal 118:22</ref></char></note>Jesuh mawng Cangcim naw a pyen ta, imsae naw ami hawiha lung cun akyäp säiha thawn law be khai, a ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Küikyannak hin ani üngkhyüh ni a law, khankhawa kea jah küikyan khaia ania thea ta Mhnam naw u pi am pe.” <verse eid="ACT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Acunüng kawngci üng ngpüikie naw Pita ja Johana ani lingnak jah hmu u lü, ca am ksingki xawi, khyang sawxat xawi tia ami ja ksing üng, aktäa cäikie; ani xawi cun ajana Jesuh hlawnga ve khawiki xawi tia ami jah ksing law. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Acunüng, Pita ja Johan naw ani mdaw be cun ani hlawnga ngdüi se ami hmuh ua kyase, ipi am pyen thei u. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Acunakyase kawngci k'um üngkhyüh jah ksät u lü ami mät ngthähngkhyahkie. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>“Hin xawi hin ihawkba mi jah pawh vai u ni? Müncam phya kcangki pawhki xawi ni tia, Jerusalem mlüha veki avan naw ksingkie; mimi naw pi mi ksingki. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Acunsepi, khyangea veia am ani jah mtheh hü vaia, atuh üng tün lü, ua veia pi hina Jesuha ngming üng käh ani jah mtheh hü vai ja mi jah pawh vai u ami ti.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Acunüng, Pita ja Johan jah khü u lü, Jesuha ngming pyen lü käh ani jah mthei vaia ami jah mtheh. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Acunsepi, Pita ja Johan naw ami msang ta, “Pamhnama hmuha Pamhnama ngthu ngaih hin dawki aw, nangmia ngthu ngaih hin daw bawk khai aw ti cun ngai sum u. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Keini ta kani hmuh ja kani ngjak cun am pyen lü am ve thei ni ngü” ani ti. <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Acunüng, kawngci ngvaie naw jah mkyüh kse hlen be tü u lü, ami jah mhlät be. Acunüng, ani bilawha phäha khyang naküt naw Pamhnam mküimtokie; khyangea phäha ami jah khuimkhanak vaia am hmu lü vekie. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Müncam phya khaia ani mdaw be cun kum kphyükipa kthaka dämkia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeikie lingnak vaia ktaiyükie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Acunüng, Pita ja Johan cun ani lät be ja, ani püiea venaka cit ni lü, ktaiyüe ngvaie ja angvaie naw ani veia ami pyen naküt ani ja mtheh be. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Ex 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Sal 146:6</ref></char></note>Acunüng, acun ami ngjak üng, atänga Pamhnama veia ami ktaiyü ta, “Bawipa aw, nang khankhaw, khawmdek ja mlik tui ja a k'uma veki naküt mhnünkia na kyaki; <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25,26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Sal 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref> (LXX)</char></note>nang naw, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am, na mpya Davit kami pupa naw a pyen ta, ‘Ise khyang mjü kce ami mlungsoki? Ise khyange naw, am ngtähkia ngaikie ni? <verse eid="ACT 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Khawmdek sangpuxange ja jah upkie naw atänga ngkhyum u lü, Bawipa ja Mesijah cun jah ngtük ngkhaih püikie ni’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Lk 23:7-11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Lk 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Jn 18:28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref></char>
    </note>“Hina mlüh üng na mpya ngcim Jesuh, Mesijaha na mcawn hneng u lü, Herod ja Pontas Pilat cun khyang mjü kcee ja Isarele akcanga ngkhyumkie ni. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Thawn law khaia na khyaihnak ja na ngjak'hlüa ajana na mhnün päng cän pawh khaiea atänga ngcun lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Acunüng, Bawipa aw, atuh ami jah mkyüh hin büktenga; na mpya xawi hin lingnak am na ngthu jah pyensaka. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Khyange jah mdaw be khai xawia, nang naw na kut säng lü; na mpya ngcim Jesuha ngming am, müncamnak ja cäicatnak jah pawhsak kawm pi” tia, ktaiyükie.<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Acunüng, acukba ami ktaiyü law päng ja, ngkhäm u lü, ami venak cun ngsün lawki. Ami van Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be law u lü Pamhnama ngthu cun ling lü sangkie.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeikie naw ami tak ng’yetkie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">Ngs 2:44</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:45">45</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, jummeikia khyange cun, mlung mat takie. U naw pi ami ka üng ka kaa ni am ti u. Ami tak cun avan naw ng’yeteikie. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Acunüng, ngsä he naw johit däm üng Bawi Jesuha thawnak be cun saksi na u se; ami khana dawkyanak Mhnam naw jah peki. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Acunüng, ami veia hlükawki u am ve; ime ni, laie ni, jah takie naw jawi u lü, ami jawiha phu ja lawpüi u lü, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>ngsä hea khaw kunga, jah ta law u se, hlükawki üng ahlükawa kba ami jah yet.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Acunüng, Josep, Kuparuh khaw khyang, Levih paca, ngsä he naw Banabah ami ti, (Acun cun “ngjuktha jah pe theiki”) naw, <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>a lo jawi lü, a yah ngui cun law püi lü, ngsä he üng a jah ap.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Anani ja Saphira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Acunsepi, khyang mat Anani ngmingnaki, a khyu Saphira am veki xawi; Ani xawi naw khawhnün jawi lü, <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>a khyua ksinga khawhnün phu avang thup lü, avang däk lawpüi lü Ngsäea khaw kunga a tak law. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw, “Anani aw, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim na mhlei na khai ja, khawhnün phu avang na mji khaia, ise khawyam naw na mlung üng bi a bi ni? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Acuna khawhnün cun a ve ham üng na kaa am kyaki aw? Na jawih käna a phu haw na kaa am kya se aw? Ise hikba na ngaiki ni? Khyang na mhleiki am ni, Pamhnam na mhleiki” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Acunüng, Anani naw acuna ngthu a ngjak ja kyu lü thiki; acunüng, ksingkie naküt cun aktäa kyüheikie. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Acunüng, cawngpyange naw ngdüi law u lü, a yawk hlawp u lü kawtkie naw ami va k’ut.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Acunkäna, naji kthum bang anghjawk ja, a khyu i am ksing lü, lut lawki. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pita naw, “Na mtheha, khawhmün cun hihah däka aw nani jawi?” ti lü, a kthäh. Acunüng, ani naw, “Ä hihah däka ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Acunüng, Pita naw, “Ise Bawipaa Ngmüimkhya cam khaia nani büki ni? Tenga, na cei k’utkiea khawleh mkawt peia veki, nang pi ni kawt hnga khaie” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Acun üng angxita, a khaw kunga kyu lü thi sawxatki; acunüng, cawngpyange lut lawki he naw thi se hmu u lü, kawt u lü a ceia peia ami k’ut hnga. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Acunüng, sangcime avan ja acuna ngjakie naküt naw aktäa kyüheikie.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Müncamnake ja cäicingnak he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Acunüng, khyangea ksunga Pamhnam naw, Ngsäea khyüh müncamkse ja cäicingnak phyaki he khawha, jah biki. Acunüng, ami cun ami ngkhä mlung mat ta u lü, Solamona mkawt ami tia, atänga nghmukie. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Khyang kce u pi ami veia am ngkhaw dat; acunsepi khyange naw aktäa jah mhlünmtaikie. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Acunüng, Bawipa jumei law kthaikia nghnumie ja kpamie khawha cun ami veia ngkhaw lawki; <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Acunüng, Pita cit hü lü a hnge naw a jah hneh vaia am myakie cun lama jah kawt law u lü ihnake ja phakea khana ami jah takie. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Acunüng, Jerusalem mlüh pipeia kae am myakie, khawyai ksea jah venake cun jah law püi u lü lawki he; acune cun mya be päihkie.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngsäe ami jah mkhuimkha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Acunüng, ktaiyü ngvai säih ja a püie Sadukee law u lü ngsä he ami jah ng’eiha phäh ami khana bi vaia ngtängkie. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Ngsä xawi jah man u lü thawngim üng ami jah khyum. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Acunakyase mthana, Bawipa khankhawngsä mat naw thawng ksawhe jah mhmawng law lü akpung da jah cehpüiki naw, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Cit ni, temple k'uma ngdüi ni lü, khyangea veia xünnak kthaia mawng va pyen nia” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Acunüng, acuna ngthu ani ngjak ja, khaw thai law üng temple k'uma lut ni lü, jah va mtheimthangki xawi. Acunsepi, ktaiyü ngvai ja a püie law u lü, bawi ja, Judah ngvaie naküt cun kawngcia mkhäm lawki he naw, angsä xawi cun thawngim üngkhyüh ami ja lawpüi vaia thawngim da khyang ami ja tüih. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Acunsepi, jung ngvaie ami pha law üng thawngima angsä xawi cun am jah hmu u; acunüng, nghlat law be u lü kawngci a ami jah va mtheh, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>“Thawngim cun üp yekia ngkhai se, mtätkie pi ksawh peia ngdüi u se kami jah hmuh; acunsepi, kami mhmawng üng, a k'uma u pi am ja hmuh ve üng” ti u lü, ami ja mtheh law. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Acunüng, temple mtätkie ja ktaiyü ngvaie naw acuna ngthu ami ngjak üng, hikba ngsä hea ve hin i a ngjo ni tia, aktäa cäicingkie. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Acunüng, khyang mat law lü ami veia, “Teng u, thawngima khyang nami ja khyum xawi naw temple k'uma ngdüi ni lü khyange jah mtheimthang ve ni” a ti law. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Acunüng, temple ngvai cun ami khyange am va cit u lü, khyange naw lung am ami jah kawng vai kyüh u lü, angsä xawi cun akdawa ami jah lawpüi be u.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Acunüng, ja pha lawpüikie naw, Kawngci ja ktaiyü ngvai säiha hmaia jah ngdüihsak lü ami jah kthäh. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mt 27:25</ref></char></note>“Ahina ngming am käh nani jah mthei ti vai, tia kami ning jah mtheh päng, ngthu nani ja mtheinak cun Jerusalem üng ngthang hüki, “nani pawh cun ngai nia” ti lü a jah pyen. Ania thinak hin keimi khana nani phaw lawsak vaia nani pawhki aw.<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Acunsepi, Pita ja ngsä kcee naw, “Khyanga pyen kami ngaiha kthaka Pamhnama pyen ni kani ngai khawm. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>“Nangmi naw Jesuh kutlamktung üng taih u lü, nami hnim cän kami pupaea Pamhnam naw mtho be pängki ni. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>“Ani cun Pamhnam naw khawngmang ja küikyankia ve khaia Isarele ami mkhyekatnak üngkhyüh ngjut be lü ja mhlät khaia a khet da mhlünmtaiki. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Acuna saksia kani kyaki ni; Ngmüimkhya Ngcim, Pamhnam bänak cun ani kcangnakia phäh ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Acunüng, acuna ngthu kawngci vawne naw ami ngjak üng, ami mlungso law se, Ngsäe cun jah hnim law hlükie. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Acunsepi, Kawngci üngka khyang, a ngming Kamaleilah naki, Phariseea thum ksingki, khyange naküt üng a ngming ngthangki cun ngdüi law lü angsä xawi cun ami jah khyah be vaia a jah mtheh. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Acunüng, Kawngcia veia, “Nangmi Isarel khyange aw, hin xawia khana nami pawh vaia nami bü cän cäi lü ngai ma ua. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>“Ahlana pi, Theuhdah naw, ‘Kei khyang sawxat am ni’ ti lü ve se; a veia khyang khawha, phyakphyü bang a veia ngdawn vaikie. Acunsepi ani cun hnim u se, a ngthu läkie naküt pi avan cencawn hü päih u lü, ia am kya bekie ni. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>“Ania ve käna, ngming yu u lü ami mkhäm k'um üng, Kalilea ka Judah naki ve law beki; a veia khyang khawhah citkie. Acunsepi, ani pi thi se, a hnu läkie avan khyük päihkie. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>“Acunakyase, atuh ka ning jah mtheki, hina khyange käh ja pana u, ani büa ve u se; ani mkhyäp ja ani bilawh, khyanga pawh sawxata akya üng amdanga khyük be sawxat khai ni; <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>acunsepi, Pamhnama bilawha, akya üng, am jah näng thei uki; am acunüng, Pamhnam nami tukia ksaia nami kya khai ni” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Acunüng, acuna pyen cun ngaisim u lü, angsä xawi cun jah khükie naw ami jah kpai; ami ja kpai päng üng Jesuha ngming am ngthu käh sang hü be ti khai xawia ami ja khyah be. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Acunüng, Kawngci üngka naw cit be ni lü, acuna Jesuha phäh luthui hmaisetnak khamei khaia ani nglawia phäha, aktäa jekie. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Acunüng, amhnüp tä se, temple ja khyangea ima, Jesuh Mesijah mawng cun jah mtheimthang lü sangkie.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jah kuei khai khyüh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ivei am law ham se, axüisawe nung law u lü, Krik ngthu pyenki Judahe ja Judah ngthu pyenkie cun mtumbäkie. Krik ngthu pyenkie naw kami hmeinue ngcawn ami teyet üng ami jah hawih u ni ami ti. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Acunüng, a ngsä xaleinghngihe naw jumki khyange avan ja khü u lü “Pamhnama ngthu pyen, hawih u lü ngui xüia phäh kami bi hin am daw ve. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Acunakyase, ka püie, nami ksunga Ngmüimkhya ja themnak am bekia khyang khyüh xü ua, amimi cun ahin, khut na khaiea kami ja mcawn khai; <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>kamimäta, ktaiyünak ja ngthu pyennaka khutbi akcün täse kami bi khai” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Acuna ngthu naw avan cun a jah jesak; acunüng, jumeinak ja Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am beki Stephen, Philip, Pyakhaw, Nikanor, Tihmon, Parmenah, ja khyangmjükce Judahea jumnak üng ngpyawtki Antiok üngka Nikolah cun ami jah xü. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Acune cun Ngsäea hmaia ja ngdüisak u se, Ngsäe naw ami kut taih u lü ami jah ktaiyü pet.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Acunüng, Pamhnama ngthu cun hnün khawha üng pha hü se; Jerusalema axüisawe aktäa nung law dämdämkie. Acunüng, ktaiyüe üngkae khawha naw jumnak yahkie.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen ami man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Acunüng, Stephen cun Mhnama dawkyanak ja johit am be lü khyangea veia cäicatnake ja müncamkse jah pawhki. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Acunsepi, khyang avang, “Sinakok üngka mpya kläte”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mpyakläte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahine cun mpyaki Judahe, lüpi khyaih khameikie am ani üng ami jah mläte.</char></note> ami ti cun Kurinih hnea Judahe, Aleksandria hnea Judahe, Kilikih hnea khyange, Asah hnea khyange naw lawsih u lü Stephen cun ami ngcuh lawpüi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Acunsepi, Ngmüimkhyaa pet themnaka phäh Stephen ngthu a pyen üng am näng khawh u. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Acunüng, khyange ami hlei pyen khaiea; acune naw, “Mosi ja Pamhnam jah kpetnaka ngthu pyen se kami ngjaki” ami ti vaia ami jah kcük. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Acunüng, khyange cun, angvaie ja thum ksinge ami jah ksük, ami mlungso law lü, Stephen cun man u lü kawngcia ami cehpüi u. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Acunüng, ami hlei pyen khaiea ja ksük u se; acune naw, “Hin naw, hina ngcimcaihkia Temple ja Mosia Thum ja kse naki; <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Hina Nazaret Jesuh naw hina Temple phyeh lü Mosi naw a jah peta thume jah nglatsak khaia a pyen kami ngjaki ni” ami ti. <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Acunüng, Kawngci üng ngawki he naw Stephen cun bükteng u lü, a hmai cun khankhawngsäa hmaia mäiha ami hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Stephena ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Acunüng, ktaiyü ngvai naw, “Acuna ngthu kcangki aw?” ti lü, Stephen a kthäh. <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Gen 12:1</ref></char></note>Acunüng Stephen naw msang lü, “Ka bee jah ka pae aw, ngai ua, mi pupa Abraham, Haran khawa am a ceh ham üng Mesopotemiha Pamhnama hlüngtainak a veia ngdang law lü, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>“Na khaw ja na im üngka naw cit lü ka ning mhnuh vaia pea cita” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Gen 11:31</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Gen 12:4</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Abraham cun Khalade khaw üngka naw cit lü Haran khawa va veki; acunüng, a pa a thih käna hina atuh nami venak khawa Pamhnam naw a ngkawnsak. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Gen 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref> </char></note>Acunüng, hia ta a venak vai, a khawpa a takeinak vai pi Pamhnam naw am pe; acunsepi, amät ja a ngsawne cäpa khawh a jah pet vaia am a ca ham üng tün lü khyütamki. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6,7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Gen 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Pamhnam naw, ‘Na mjükphyüie khyanga khawa kum phyakphyü ve khaie, khyanga mpyaa ve u se, jah khuimkha khaie’ tia a pyen. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Ex 3:12</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Pamhnam naw, ‘Amimi jah mpya na khaia khyang mjüe pi kamät naw ami lei ka jah mtai law pe khai. Acun käna lät law be u lü, hina hnün üng na hjawkhah law khaie’ a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Gen 17:10-14</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Gen 21:2-4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Gen 25:26</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31-35:18">Gen 29:31—35:18</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Pamhnam naw vun mawih vaia ngthumkhän pe se; acunüng, Abraham naw Isak ca na lü amhnüp khyetnak üng a vun a mawi pet; acunüng, Isak naw Jakop ca na se, Jakop naw a ca xaleinghngihea vun a jah mawih pet acune cun nglo ngthangkie mi pupae ni.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: a</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Gen 37:11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Gen 37:28</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:2">Gen 39:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Jakopa cae naw ami na Josep k’eih u lü Egypt pea ami jawihei; acunsepi, Pamhnam naw vepüi lü, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Gen 41:39-41</ref></char></note>a khuikhanak naküt üng küikyanki. Josep cun Egypt sangpuxanga maa a pha vai üng Pamhnam naw ani üng themnak ja a hmai vainak pe se, Pharo sangpuxang naw Egypt pe ja a im üng ngvai säiha a mcawn. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1">Gen 42:1</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 42:2">2</ref></char></note>Egypt ja Kanan pe avan üng khawjaw law se, khuikhanak aktäa ve lawki; mi pupae cun ami ei vai i am ta u lü vekie. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Acunsepi, Jakop naw Egypt pea cang veki tia ksing lü a cae a jah tüih; acun cun ami cehnak akcüksäiha kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Gen 45:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:16">Gen 45:16</ref></char></note>Acunüng, anghngihnaka ami ceh üng, Josep cun a beea üng jah mtheh se; acunüng, Josepa khuiima mawng cun Pharo naw a jah ksing law. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9">Gen 45:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:18">18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:27">Gen 46:27</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acunüng, Josep naw a pa Jakop ja a benae naküt a jah khüsak; ami van khyühkip ja hma lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Gen 46:1-7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:33">Gen 49:33</ref></char></note>Jakop cun Egypt pea ju citki; acunüng, ani ja a tucae cun thikie. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Gen 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref></char></note>Ami yawke cun Sikem khawa jah cepüi u lü Abraham naw Sikem khawa Hamoa sanga veia ngui am a khyäiha ng'uhnak üng ami ja k’ut.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17,18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Ex 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>“Acunüng, Pamhnam naw Abrahama veia khyütam akpha law hlü üng, Jakopa mjükphyüie cun Egypt pea nung mja lawki he. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Josep am ksingkia sangpuxang akce naw Egypt cun up lawki. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10">Ex 1:10</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:11">11</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Ex 1:22</ref></char></note>Ani naw mi pupae jah mkhuimkha lü hnasen he pi thi khaia im üngkhyüh a jah xawt tawnsak. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Ex 2:2</ref></char></note>Acunüng Pamhnama hmaia aktäa ngtokia, Mosi hmi law se, a pa ima khya kthum ami mcah; <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Ex 2:3-10</ref></char></note>acun käna ami tawnnaka, Pharoa canu naw lo lü amäta ca vaia a mcahei. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Acunüng Mosi cun Egypt pea ami ksingkhyapnak naküt jah mthei u se, bilawnak ja pyensaknak thei üng be lawki.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Ex 2:11-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kum kphyükip a cum üng, a püi Isarele ihawkba vekie ti cun ja va bükteng khaia ngtängki. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Acunüng Isarel khyang mat Egypt khyang naw khuimkha se hmu lü, yungki naw Egypt khyang cun a hnim. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>(Pamhnam naw ani am a khyange jah yung khai tia, a khyange naw ksing khaiea ngai sepi, am ksing u.) <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Angawi law be tü üng amimät üngka xawi ngtunngpyei nise jah hmu law lü, ‘Ka püi xawi aw, bengna xawia nani kyaki, ise nani ngtunngpyeiki ni?’ ti lü ja mkhya khaia bü se, <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>a püi ngtunpüiki naw Mosi buk lü, ‘Kani khana suki ja ngthumkhyah mkhawnga u naw aning mcawn ni? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Müta Egypt khyang na hnima kba na na hnim khaia na büki aw?’ a kthäh. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3">Ex 18:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 18:4">4</ref></char></note>Acun a ngjaka phäha Mosi Midian pea cen lü, acuia cakpa nghngih a canak.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Ex 3:1-10</ref> </char>
    </note>Kum kphyükip a nghjawk käna, Sinai mcung pei khawkhyawng khawa meia däiki kpyap üngka naw, khankhawngsä mat a veia ngdang lawki. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Mosi naw acun a hmu üng, aktäa cäi lü bükteng khaia a va k’et üng, Bawipa kthai naw, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‘Kei cun na pupaea Pamhnam ni, Abrahama Pamhnam, Isaka Pamhnam, Jakopa Pamhnam ni’ ti se, acunüng, Mosi naw kyüh lü am a bükteng dat. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Acunüng, Bawipa naw, ‘Na khawdawk cän suta; isetiakyaküng na ngdüinak cän hnün ngcimcaiha mdek ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Egypt pea ka khyang vekiea ami khuikhanak aktäa hmu veng, ami ngko pi ngja veng, ami jah küikyan khaia ka kyum lawki ni. Tuhkbäih cita, Egypt pea ka ning tüih khai’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Ex 2:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acuna Mosi, ‘Kani khana suki ja ngthumkhyah mkhawnga u naw aning mcawn ni?’ tia Isarele naw ami mah cun, kpyapa k'uma a veia ngdang lawkia khankhawngsä naw kpüi se, Pamhnam naw ani kung cun ngvai ja küikyan khaia a tüiha kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Ex 7:3</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Ex 14:21</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:33">Num 14:33</ref></char></note>Ani naw Egypt pe, Mpanglai Sen ja khawkhyawng khawa kum kphyükip üng, cäicatnak vaie ja müncamkse ja pawh lü a ja ngkhah lawpüi. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Deut 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note>Isarel khyange üng ‘Pamhnam naw kei ana mcawna mäiha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ani kei a na tüih lawa kba; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">keia kba.</char></note> nami benae üngka sahma mat ning ja mcawn pe khai’ ti lü jah mthehki cun acuna Mosia kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Ex 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Deut 5:1-33</ref></char></note>Ani cun, khawkhyawng khawa ngkhämkiea veia pi kyase, Sinai mcunga ngthuheipüikia khankhawngsäa veia pi kyase, ja mjükphyüi nakiea veia pi kyase ve lü mimi a jah pet vaia xüngseiki Pamhnama ngthu yahkia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Ania ngthu cun mi pupae naw käh ngai u lü, ami mlung üng Egypt pea nghlat be vai ngjahlükie. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Ex 32:1</ref></char></note>Acunakyase Arona veia, ‘Ja ngkhahpüi khaia mhnam he jah pyan peta; Egypt pe üngka naw jah lawpüikia Mosi ihawkba veki ni am ksing ve üng’ ami ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Ex 32:2-6</ref></char></note>Acunüng, seca juktuh pyang u lü, acun cun xüngsei hnimki he naw hjawkhah u lü, amimäta kuta pyang cun ngkengtai u lü hlimtuikie. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42,43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5:25-27</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acunakyase Pamhnam naw akcea ja jah nghlat ta lü, khankhawa aisie jah hjawkhah khaiea a jah pawh; acun cun sahmaea yuknak caup üng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Isarel khyange aw, khawkhyawng khawa kum kphyükip üng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">axüngksei jah hnim u lü ngkengnak nami bilawh hin kei nami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">na hjawkhahnak am ni.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Sama k'uma veki Moluk mhnam ceh hü lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">aisi mhnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Rephan pi nami hjawkhah vaia a lup nami pyangki, acunakyase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Babalung pea nami mpya khaia ka ning jah tüih khai’ tia veki.<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Ex 25:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char>
    </note>Mi pupae naw khawkhyawng khawa Mhnama venak vai sam takie. Acun cun Mhnama phäh nami pyan vai cun Mosi üng mtheh kba sam nami takie. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3:14-17</ref></char></note>Acun käna, mi pupaea naw sam cun lo u lü Josuh mah maha cit u lü cehpüikie, acun cun Pamhnam naw ni maa a jah ksät khyangmjüea khawa takie. Acun hin Davita a ve law cäpa acua veki. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Sam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:1-14">2Khro 17:1-14</ref></char></note>Acuna Davit cun Pamhnama mpyeneinak yah lü, Jakopa Pamhnama venak vai pyang khaia kthähki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jakopa Pamhnam; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isarel khyange.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Sang 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2Khro 3:1-17</ref></char></note>Acunsepi, Solamon naw ni im cun a sak. <verse eid="ACT 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Acunsepi, hlüngtai säihkia Mhnam cun khyanga kut am saka im üng am ve khawi; sahma naw pyen lü:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49,50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Hesa 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Bawipa naw, ‘Khankhaw cun ka Bawingawhnaka kyaki, khawmdek cun ka khawpha ka mtaihnaka kyaki, im ia mäih nami na sak hlü peki ni? Ka venaka hnün cun ia mäih ni?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Kamäta kut am anaküt ka ja mhnünkia am kya aw?’ ti ve, ti lü a pyen ni.<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Hesa 63:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Stephen naw msu lü, “Nami mlung ngcang ve, Pamhnama ngthu am nami ngjaki, anglät se Ngmüimkhya Ngcim nami mahki; nami pupaea ve ja nami ve täng ve. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nami pupae naw sahmae am ami khuimkha khawi veki aw? Law khaia Ngsungpyunkia Mpyaa mawng sang lawki he Pamhnama ngsä he jah hnimki he. Atuh pi ani cun phyehei lü nami hnimki. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Mhnama thum, khankhawngsä hea naw ami ning jah pet cän yah u lü am nami läki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen lung am ami khawngnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Acunüng, acuna ngthu cun kawngci khyange naw ami ngjak ja ami mlungso law se, Stephena khana mnicui kyetkie.<verse eid="ACT 7:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Acunsepi, Stephen cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am bekia kya lü, khankhawa hang mangki naw, Pamhnama hlüngtainak ja Pamhnama khet lama Jesuh ngdüi se a hmu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Acunüng, Stephen naw, “Teng u.” “Khankhaw nghmawng lü Pamhnama khet lama Khyanga Cakpa ngdüiki pi hmu veng” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Amimi cun angsanga ngpyang u lü, ami nghnga jah kbümeikie naw, atänga kyaksih u lü, <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>mlüh k'um üngka naw akpunga kaih u lü, lung am ami khawng. Saksi vai ami suisake cun Sawluh ngming naki cawngpyang mata khaw kunga ami jah tak. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Acunüng, lung am aktäa ami khawng k'um üng, Stephen naw, “Bawipa Jesuh aw! ka Ngmüimkhya labea” ti lü ktaiyüki. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Acunüng, a mkhuk ngdäng lü, angsanga ngpyang lü, “Bawipa aw, hina ami mkhyekatnak cän käh ja thung be kawpi” a ti. Acuna ngthu a pyen päng ja thiki.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sawluh naw Stephen ami hnim vai jah tängpüiki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sawluh naw sangcime a jah mkhuimkha</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Acuna mhnüp üng Jerusalem mlüha veki sangcim cun aktäa mkhuimkhanak kham lawki he; acunakyase, Ngsäe däk ve hüt u se, jumeikie naküt cun Judah ja Samarih hnea ngpyeng hükie.<verse eid="ACT 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Acunüng, Pamhnam jumkie naw, Stephen cun k’ut u lü, aktäa ami kya.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4">Ngs 22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Sawluh naw sangcime aktäa a jah khuimkha, im naküt üng lut hü lü jumeikia nghnumi kpamie jah man lü jah kaih hü lü, thawngim üng a jah khyum.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samarih hnea thangkdaw sangnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Acunüng, pyeng hükia jumkie naw hne naküt üng cit u lü ngthu pyen hükie.<verse eid="ACT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Philip cun Samarih hnea mlüh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mlüh ktung; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mlüh.</char></note> ktunga ju citki naw, Mesijaha mawng khyange veia a ju pyen.<verse eid="ACT 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Khyange naw, ngja u lü Philip naw a mdana müncam phyaki he ami jah hmu üng, a ngthu pyen cun aktäa ami ngaih.<verse eid="ACT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Isetiakyaküng, khawksea jah venake ami k'um üngka naw khawyaie ngpyang u lü lut lawki he. A khaw kceke ja xokie pi ami daw law bea phäha kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Acuna mlüh üngkae cun aktäa jekyaikie.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Sihmon ngming nakia khyang mat veki; ani naw, ajana acuna mlüh üng, sui pawh lü Samarih khyange jah cäicatsak khawikia kyaki. “Kei cun khyang sawxat am ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Mlüha veki naküt khyang akdik akdäm naküt naw “Ani hin ‘Hlüngtaikia Johit’ tia ngthangkia Pamhnama Johit ni” ti lü a ngthu pyen cun mcek lü ngaikie.<verse eid="ACT 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>A sui bilaw am, aksoa cäicat kphyaki he a ja bilawh khawha phäha, a ngthu cun aktäa ami münnak.<verse eid="ACT 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnama pe thangkdaw ja Jesuh Khritawa ngming thangkdaw Philipa pyen ami jum ja, nghnumi kpami Baptican khan lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Sihmon naw pi jum law hnga lü Baptican a kham law päng ja Philipa hlawnga ve lü, müncamkse ja müncamnak a jah pawh cun hmu lü cäiki.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Acunüng, Jerusalema vekia Ngsäe naw Samarih hnea khyange naw pi Pamhnama ngthu jumkie tia ami ksing law üng, ami veia Pita ja Johan ami jah tüih;<verse eid="ACT 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>acu xawi ani ju pha üng, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ami yahnak vaia ami jah ktaiyü pet.<verse eid="ACT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Am acun ham üng ta ua khana Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am pha law; Bawi Jesuha ngming am Baptican däk va khan hamkiea kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Angsä xawi naw ami khana ani kut taih ni se, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim yaheikie.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Acunüng, Ngsäea kut taiha phäha Ngmüimkhya Ngcim pha lawki ti cun Sihmon naw a hmuh. Acunüng ngui cun Pita ja Johana veia lawpüiki naw,<verse eid="ACT 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>“Kei pi, khyange khana ka kut taih ngüse, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ami yahnak thei vaia johit na pe nia” ti lü a jah kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Pamhnama bäkhäknak cun a ngui am khyäi khaia a büa phäha, Pita naw, “Na xünak ja na ngui mulaia cit ni se,<verse eid="ACT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>na mlung Pamhnama hmaia käh ngsungpyunkia kyase, hin üng käh na ngpüi hngaki, na ham pi am ve;<verse eid="ACT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>acunakyase, na mkhyekatnak ngjut lü Bawipa veia ktaiyüa, acunüng, na mlung üng na ngaihnak ni mhlät khai ni.<verse eid="ACT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>“Nang cun püi ng’eihnak am bebang lü mkhyekatnaka thawng kyuma na kyaki ti ksing veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Acunüng, Sihmon naw, nani pyen ka khana am a pha lawnak vaia, nangni naw Bawipa veia na ktaiyü pe nia” ti lü Pita ja Johan a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Acunüng, ani xawi naw saksi ja Bawipa ngthu ami ksingsak käna, Jerusalem mlüha citbeki xawi. Ani ceh sawa Samarih ngnam khawhah üng Thangkdaw sangki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philip ja Ethiopia ngvai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Bawipaa khankhawngsä mat naw Philipa veia, “Tho law lü Jerusalem üngkhyüh Kaza khawa cehnaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">acum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mhnüp nglung.</char></note> lam üng cita” a ti (Acuna lam cun tuh ta am sumei ti u.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ahina lam tuha am sumei ti u; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ahin hin khawkhyawng lam ni.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Acunüng, tho law lü citki. Acua Ethiopia khawa Candace, Ethiopia upki nghnumia khawthem naküt msümcei lü nghnumi awmki cun Jerusalem khawa Pamhnam va hjawkhah khaia citki;<verse eid="ACT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>a nglat law be lama, a senghlea khana ngaw lü sahma Hesajah cauk üngka kheki.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Acunüng, Ngmüimkhya naw Philipa veia, “Cana senghle veia cit lü a hlawnga va vea” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Acunüng, Philip cun acuna ngvaia veia va cit lü sahma Hesajaha cauk khe se ngjaki naw, “Na khea asuilam na ksingki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Ani naw, “U naw am a na mtheh cun ihawkba ka ksing thei khai ni?” a ti. Acunüng, a veia ngaw hnga khaia Philip cun a khü.<verse eid="ACT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:32,33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Hesa 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Acunüng, Cangcim a khe cun:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:32">“Hnim vaia toa mäiha ani cun ami cehpüi; To a mu ami kteih üng käh khihkheh lü a vea mäiha, ani pi käh khihkheh lü veki;<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Ani cun hnemnak a khamei üng, am cangkia lei ami mtai pet; u naw pi a mjükphyüi mawng am pyen khawh u, isetiakyaküng khawmdeka ania sak cun päihki” kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Acunüng, ngvai naw Philipa veia, “Sahma naw hin hin ua mawng ni a pyen? Amäta mawng mä, khyang kcea mawng mä? Ni kthäh veng na mtheha” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Philip naw, thangkdaw cun ahina Cangcim üngkhyüh tünei lü Jesuha mawng cun a mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Acunüng, lam ani ceh k'um üng, tuia venak pha ni se; ngvai naw, “Tenga, hin üng tui ve ve, Baptican kham vaia i naw na kyawhki ni?” ti se,<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Philip naw, “Na mlungmthin avan am na jumei üng na kham theiki” ti se; ngvai naw, “Jesuh Khritaw, Pamhnama Cakpaa kyaki ti ka jumki” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Acunüng, angvai naw senghle ngdüihsak lü, Philipa dä ngvai cun tui da citki xawi. Acun üng Philip naw Baptican a khamsak.<verse eid="ACT 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Acunüng, tui üngka naw ani thaw law be ja, Bawipaa Ngmüimkhya naw Philip cun cehpüi. Angvai naw Philip am hmu ti kyaw lüpi jekyainak am amäta lama citbeki.<verse eid="ACT 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Acunsepi, Philip cun Azuk mlüha ngdang law be lü; a ceh sawa acuna mlüh üngkhyüh Ketarih am a pha hama küt üng, mlüh naküt üng thangkdaw sang hüki.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sawluha ngthunghlainak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Ngs 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Sawluh naw Bawipa hnukläk jah mkyüh lü jah hnim khaia ngbüki naw, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Bawipa tuilam kläklamkie nghnumi kpamie naküt jah khit lü Jerusalema a jah lawpüi vaia, Damatet mlüha sinakoka veki am ca a ja pet vaia Jerusalema ktaiyü ngvaia veia kthäh khaia citki.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Acukba cit lü Damatet mlüh pei a pha law üng, khankhawa ka akvai cun angxita a peia vai law sawxatki.<verse eid="ACT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Acunüng, Sawluh mdeka khana kyu lü, “Sawluh, Sawluh, i vai na na mkhuimkhaki ni?” tia kthai a ngjak.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Sawluh naw, “Bawipa, nang u ni?” a ti. “Na mkhuimkha Jesuha ka kyaki ni; tia kthai a ngjak.<verse eid="ACT 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Acunsepi tho law lü mlüh da cita, acunüng na pawh vai ni mtheh khaie ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Acua a hlawnga cit hngakie naw kthai ngja u sepi, u am hmu u.<verse eid="ACT 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sawluh cun mdek üngka naw tho law be lü, hang mangki naw ipi am hmu thei se, a kut üng kaih u lü, Damatet mlüha ami cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Mhnüp kthum khawdei am hmu lü i am eiaw lü veki.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Acunüng, Damateta Anani ngming naki axüisaw mat veki. Pamhnam naw a ngmang üng, “Anani” a ti. Ani naw, “Bawipa aw, hia ve veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Bawipa naw a veia, “Tho law lü, lam ngdüng ami tia lama cita, Sawluh naki Tasuh mlüha ka Judaha ima va suia; acua ktaiyü lü veki ni;<verse eid="ACT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Anani ngming naki naw lut lü a mik a mdeisak be vaia, a khana a kut mtaih se, hmu päng veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Anani naw, “Bawipa aw, acun cun, Jerusalem mlüha na khyangea khana a jah mkhuimkhanak, khyang ngcim khawhah mpyawng üng ka ngjaki;<verse eid="ACT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>acunüng, hia pi na ngming pyenki naküt a jah mannak vaia ktaiyü ngvaiea veia ana yah pängki ni” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Acunsepi, Bawipa naw, “Cita, Khyangmjükcee, sangpuxange ja Isarel khyangmjükcee venaka ka ngming cehpüi khaia ka xü ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>“Ka ngminga phäha mkhuimkhanak ihlawka khamei khai tia ka ksing lawsak khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Acunüng, Anani cun va cit lü Sawluha venak ima lutki; a khana a kut mtaih lü, “Ka na Sawluh aw, na mika hmuhnak be vai ja Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am na benak vaia, na law lama Bawipa na veia ngdangki Jesuh naw a na tüih law ni” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Acunja, a mik üngka naw ngalipa nglawh lawa mäiha nglo law lü, a mik mdei law beki; acunüng, tho law lü, Baptican khanki. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Acunüng, a ei päng ja, aktha ve law beki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Damateta Sawluh naw ngthu a pyen</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Acunüng, Damatet khawa veki axüisawea veia asäng veki. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Sinakoka cit täih lü, Jesuh cun Pamhnama Cakpa akyaka mawng sangki.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>A ngthu pyen ngjaki naküt naw cäi u lü, “Hin hin, Jerusalem mlüha hina ngming pyenki naküt ja khuimkha khawikia am kya ai se? Acune cun jah khit lü ktaiyü ngvaiea veia a jah cehpüi vaia lawki ni” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Acunsepi, Sawluh cun a pyen johit am be law lü, Damateta vekia Judahea pyen naküta ngthu ja msang lü, Jesuh cun Khritaw kcanga akyaka mawng a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2Kor 11:32</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, asäng nghjawk se, Sawluh hnim khaiea Judahe nghmu u lü cengkie. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Acunsepi, Sawluh naw ami ceng a ksingei. Sawluh hnim khaiea bü u lü mkawte cun amhnüp mthana ami jah ngnäng. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Acunsepi, axüisawe naw cehpüi u lü mthana vawh üng takie naw ngvawng üngkhyüh ami ju khyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem mlüha Sawluh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Acunüng, Sawluh naw Jerusalem mlüh a pha ja, axüisawe jah ngdawn hüpüi se, axüisawa kya hngaki ti am jum u lü ami van naw ami kyühei.<verse eid="ACT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Banabah naw ngkhahpüi lü axüisawea veia lawpüiki naw, lama Bawipa hmu se a ngthuheipüia mawng, Damatet khawa am kyühei lü Jesuha ngming am ngthu a pyena mawng cun a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Acukba Sawluh cun Jerusalem khawa ami veia cit hü lü Bawipa ngming am ling lü ngthu pyenki.<verse eid="ACT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Krik khyü pyenki Judahea veia ngthu pyen se, ngcupüikie naw, hnim khaie a ami bü.<verse eid="ACT 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Acunüng, Jumeikie naw ami ksing law üng, Ketarih khawa cehpüi u lü Tasuh khawa ami tüihin u.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Sangcime cun Judah, Kalile ja Samariha dim’yenak am vekie; acunüng, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw ngjuk ktha jah pe lü khyang nung law u lü Bawipa cun aktäa kyühkie.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ludah mlüh ja jukpei mlüh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Pita cun hnün naküt üng cit hü lü Ludah mlüha veki Mhnama khyangea venaka ju citki.<verse eid="ACT 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Acua khyang mat, Eni ngming naki, xo lü kum khyet a ihnak üng ngjänki a hmu.<verse eid="ACT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Pita naw, “Eni, Jesuh Khritaw naw ning mdaw be ve; tho law lü na ngjännak pyanga” ti se, acun üng, angxita tho lawki.<verse eid="ACT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Ludah mlüh ja Saron mlüha vekie naküt naw, Eni hmu u lü, Bawipa veia nghlatkie.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Jukpei mlüh k'uma Tabitah ngmingnakia nghnumi mat veki. A Krik ngming cun Dorka naki, ‘Sa khyuk’ tinaka kyaki. Acuna nghnumi cun jumei lü, akdaw bilo lü, aktäa petmsawkia nghnumia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Acunüng, ani cun am mya lü thi se, a yawk cun mthi u lü ima khana ami mphän.<verse eid="ACT 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Acunüng, Ludah mlüh cun Jukpei mlüh khyüh am thuk, axüisawe naw Pita acua veki tia ami ksing üng, “Käh sü lü, kami veia law kawpi” tia nghui na khaia, khyang nghngih ami jah tüih.<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Acunüng, Pita cun tho law lü, ami veia cit haki. A pha ja khan ima ami cehpüi; hmeinu naküt cun a peia ngdüi u lü, Dorka naw ami veia a ve ham üng a jah pyana kcue ja jihe jah büktengsak u lü kyapkie.<verse eid="ACT 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw ami van kpunga ja lu lawsak lü a mkhuk süm lü ktaiyüki; yawk da nglat lü “Tabitah, tho law” a ti. Acunüng, mdei law lü, Pita a hmu ja tho law lü ngawki.<verse eid="ACT 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Acunüng, Pita naw a kut säng lü mthoki naw, jumeikie ja hmeinue jah khü lü, akxünga a jah mhnuh.<verse eid="ACT 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Acun cun Jukpei mlüh üngkae ami van naw ngja u lü khyang khawha naw Bawipa jumkie.<verse eid="ACT 9:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Pita cun Jukpei mlüha mhnüp khawvei savun pyangki Sihmona ima veki.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pita ja Konelih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Acunüng, Ketarih khawa Konelih ngming naki Romah cetca keptin veki, acun cun Itali yekap ngvai ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Ani cun Pamhnam üng hlimtui lü, a ima vekie ami van naw Pamhnam kyühkie, mpyenkseki Judah khyange jah petmsawt lü aktäa ktaiyüki.<verse eid="ACT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Acuna, mhnüp mülam naji kthum bang üng, Pamhnama khankhawngsä mat law lü, “Konelih aw” ti lü ngkhü lawki cun angsing hmumkthehnak a hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Acunüng, Konelih naw a kyühnak am bükteng lü, “Bawipa aw, ini?” a ti. Acunüng, ani naw, “Na ktaiyünak ja na petmsawte naw Pamhnam jesak se, Pamhnam naw na ktaiyünak ning msang khaia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>“Tuhkbäih Jukpei mlüha khyang ja tüih lü khyang mat Sihmon Pita ngming naki jah khüsaka;<verse eid="ACT 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>savun pyangkia Sihmona veia kaiki ni, a im cun mliktui peia veki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Acunüng, ngthuheipüikia khankhawngsä a ceh be ja, Konelih naw a mpya üngka nghngih ja, anglätse khüikie üngka Pamhnam üpnaki yekap mat khü lü;<verse eid="ACT 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>ngthu a jah mtheh päng üng Jukpei mlüha a jah tüih.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Angawi üng, ami ceh lam mlüh pei ami pha law hlü üng, Pita cun ktaiyü khaia im mkhyuma kaiki.<verse eid="ACT 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>A ei naw mcawi law se, bu ei law hlüki; cunsepi, a ei vai ami pawh k'um üng Mhnama mdannak a hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Khankhaw nghmawng law lü jihnua mäiha kphyüa kitmaki mdeka kya lawse a hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Acuna k'uma, khawmdek üng ngvak hükiea khisa avan ja khankhawa khae naküt vekie.<verse eid="ACT 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>A veia kthai pha lawki cun, “Pita aw, tho law; ja hnim lü jah eia” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, acukba am kya; am ngcimcaiki ja mtüikheh i am ei khawi veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Acunüng, Khana kthai naw anghnginaka, “Pamhnam naw a ngcimsak päng nang naw am ngcimcaiki käh tia” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Acukba cia kthum vei ngdang law lü; acunüng acuna jiha mäih cun khankhawa a ju jäh law be.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Pita naw mdannak a hmuh cun asuilam am ksing lü ana ve k'um üng, Koneliha a tüiha khyange naw Sihmona a im ngthäh law u lü mkawt peia ngdüi lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Sihmon Pita ngmingnaki khin cun, acua a pha ja am a pha ngpyang u lü ami ju kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Acunüng, Pita naw mdannak a hmu cun, a ngaikyu hui üng, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw a veia, “Ngaia, khyang kthum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kthum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">avang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim mat naw ta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nghngih.</char></note> naw ning sui hü ve u.<verse eid="ACT 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Acunakyase, tho law lü ju kyuma, käh cücawn lü jah läka; anini cun keia jah tüih law ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Acunüng, Pita cun, acunea veia kyum lü ami veia, “Nami sui hü hin kei ni; ia phäha nami lawki ni?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Amimi naw, “Konelih, yekap ngvai, khyang kdaw, Pamhnam kyühki, Judah khyange naküt üng ngming dawnak yaki naw a ima nang ning khü lü na ngthu pyen ngai khaia, Pamhnama khankhawngsä mat naw a mtheha kyaki” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Pita naw, acuna khyange cun im k'uma ja luhpüi lü a jah khinnak. A ngawia Pita cun tho law lü ami veia cit se, Jukpei mlüha ka, jumeikie avange pi a veia cit hngakie.<verse eid="ACT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Angawi be kce üng, Ketarih mlüha phakie. Acuia, Konelih naw a khyange ja a püie ja khü lü, anini cun ami jah na k'äih.<verse eid="ACT 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Pita a pha law üng, Konelih naw ana dokham lü a khaw kunga mbawki.<verse eid="ACT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw ani cun mtho lü, “Ngdüia, kei pi nghngicima ni ka kya ve” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>A veia a ngthuhei maha va lut lü khyang khawha ana ve se a hmu.<verse eid="ACT 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Ami veia, “Judah khyang naw khyangmjükce ngkhawtpüi lü ami veia a ceh hü vai käh nglawiki tia nami ksingki; acunsepi, ‘U pi am ngcim, phyawksak ve’ käh ka ti vaia, Pamhnam naw na mtheh pängki ni.<verse eid="ACT 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Acunakyase, na na khü law ja, käh dam lü ka lawkia kyaki. Acunakyase ka ning jah kthäh khai, “Ia phäha nami na khü lawki ni?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Konelih naw, “Ahin kcün mhnüp kthum anghjawk üng, ka ima naji kthum üng ka ktaiyü<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ktaiyü; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang naw ta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ei jeih ja ktaiyü.</char></note> k'um üng; khyang mat suisak bawk suisa lü, ka maa ngdüi lawki naw,<verse eid="ACT 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>‘Konelih aw, na ktaiyünak Pamhnam naw ngja ve, na petmsawt ja na bilawh naküt pi Pamhnam naw ksing ve.<verse eid="ACT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Acunakyase, Jukpei mlüha khyang tüi lü Sihmon, Pita ami ti cun, na veia khüa; ani cun mliktui pei, savun pyangki Sihmona ima kaiki ni’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Acunakyase, na veia khyang angxita ka tüih lawa kyaki; na law hin daw ve. Acunakyase, Bawipa naw ngthu aning mtheh naküt ngai khaia, atuh Pamhnama hmuha kami van hin üng kami veki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitaa ngthupyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deut 10:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pita naw pyen lü, “Pamhnam naw, khyang naküt atänga jah mceiki tia akcanga ka ksingki;<verse eid="ACT 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>acunsepi, au pi amät hjawkhah lü akdaw pawhkia khyang mjü naküt cun mkhawihnga lü jah dokhamki.<verse eid="ACT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>“Ani naw, acuna ngthu cun nami ksingki, acun hin Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh dim’yenaka thangkdaw Isarel veia a peta kyaki. ‘Jesuh cun khyang naküta Bawia kyaki’ tia nami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Johan naw Baptican khamnaka mawng ngthu a pyen käna, Kalile üngkhyüh cutei lü Isarel khaw naküt üng ngthu ngthang hükia münkse bilawhnake cun nangmi naw pi nami ksingki;<verse eid="ACT 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Nazaret Jesuha mawng ta ania khana Pamhnam naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ja johit am a besak; ani cun Pamhnama veia vekia kyase, khyanga khana akdaw pawh lü khawyaia jah khuimkhae naküt jah mdaw be lü cit hüki.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Judahea khaw ja Jerusalem mlüh a jah bilawh naküt kami saksinaki; ani cun kutlamktung üng taih u lü, ami hnim.<verse eid="ACT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Pamhnam naw amhnüp thum üng mtho be lü a ngdangsak,<verse eid="ACT 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>acunsepi, khyang naküta veia am kya lü, keimie kami saksi khaia Pamhnam naw a jah xü, thihnak üngkhyüh a thawh be käna amät am atänga eiaw yüm khaia a jah mtheh ni.<verse eid="ACT 10:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Acuna Bawipa cun akthie ja akxüng hea khana ngthumkhyah khaia Pamhnam naw a mcawna kyaki tia, khyangea veia sang hü khaiea, jah ksing hüsak khaiea, Pamhnam naw ngthu a jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>A u pi, ani jumeiki naküt, a ngminga phäha a mkhyekatnak mhlätnak yah khai tia, ania mawng cun sahmae naküt naw ami sang khawi ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyangmjükcee naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim yahkie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Pita naw acuna ngthu a pyen hui üng, ngthu ngjakie naküta khana, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim pha lawki.<verse eid="ACT 10:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Pitaa veia law hngakie Judah jumeiki khyange naw, khyangmjükceea khana pi Pamhnam naw Ngmüimkhya Ngcim a pha lawsak hmu u lü cäikie.<verse eid="ACT 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Käh ksinga ngthu am ngthuhei u lü Pamhnam mhlünmtai u se, ami jah ksinga phäha kyaki. Acunüng, Pita naw jah msang lü,<verse eid="ACT 10:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>“Hine, mimi mäiha Ngmüimkhya Ngcim yah hngakie cun tui üng Baptican am khan khaiea, u naw a jah khyawh ni?” ti lü,<verse eid="ACT 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Jesuh Khritawa ngming am Baptican khan khaiea a jah mtheh. Acun käna Pita cun ami veia asäng ve khaia ami nghuinak.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem sangcimea veia Pitaa khyü cük</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Judah khawa vekiea Ngsäe ja jumeikie naw, khyangmjükcee naw pi Pamhnama ngthu ja hngakie tia ami ksing.<verse eid="ACT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Acunüng, Pita Jerusalema a ceh üng, vun mawi hlükie khyangmjükcee naw pi Pita cun kcäh u lü,<verse eid="ACT 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>“Ami vun am mawikiea ima lut lü ami veia na ei haki” ti u lü ami ngcuhpüi.<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw aphung üng tünei lü ja mthehki naw,<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>“Jukpei mlüha ktaiyü lü ka veki; acunüng, jinua mäih üng khankhawa ka naw kya law se ka hmu; ka pei yea na k’et lawki;<verse eid="ACT 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>acun bükteng lü ka ngaikyu hui üng, khisae naküt khawmdek üng ngvak hükie ja khana khae ka jah hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Acunüng, kthai naw, ‘Pita, tho law, jah hnim lü ja eia’ ti se, ka ngjak.<verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Acunsepi, kei naw, ‘Bawipa aw, acukba am kya, am ngcimcaiki ja mtüikheh ka mka üng am ju lut khawi naw’ ka ti.<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Acunsepi, khankhawa ka kthai naw, ‘Pamhnam naw a ngcimcaihsak haw cen, nang naw am ngcimki käh tia’ ti lü a na msang.<verse eid="ACT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Acukba kthum vei a ve law päng üng, avan khankhawa a jähei be.<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Acunüng, khyang kthum, Ketarih mlüha kae cun ka veia jah tüi law u se, ka venaka ima pha lawki he.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei,</char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">keimi.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Ngmüimkhya naw käh cücawn lü ka ja läk khaia a na tüih. Hina jumeiki khyuke naw pi na läk law hnga u se, Koneliha ima kami lutkie;<verse eid="ACT 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>ani naw, a ima khankhaw ngsä ngdüi se a hmuh ja, khankhaw ngsä naw a veia, ‘Jukpei mlüha khyang tüi lü, Sihmon Pita ami ti jäng laksaka;<verse eid="ACT 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>ani naw ngthu ning mtheh se, acuna ngthu am nang ja na khui im kyawnglawng cun küikyana nami kya khai’ a tia mawng a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Acunüng, ngthu cutei lü ka pyen law ja, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim akcüka mi khana a pha lawa mäiha, amimia khana pi pha lawki.<verse eid="ACT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:5">Ngs 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng Bawipa ngthu, ‘Johan naw tui am khyang Baptican jah peki, acunsepi nangmi cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üng Baptican nami khan khai’ a ti, ka süm law beki.<verse eid="ACT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Pamhnam naw Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw mi jumei ja, amdanga a jah peta khawh cun khyangmjü kcee pi acuna khawh a jah pet hnga üng, kei cun ia kya lü acuna Pamhnam ka ma khai ni?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Acuna ngthu ami ngjak ja, jum u lü, “Acuna akyaküng, Pamhnam naw khyangmjükcee haw ngjut be u lü xünnak ami ya vaia mawng cun ja pe ha ve” ti u lü Pamhnam mküimtokie.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok mlüh üngka sangcim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Ngs 8:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Stephena phäha ami jah khuimkhae, Phonisia, Kuparuh ja Antiok mlüh cäpa dawng hü u lü Judah khyange dänga veia Pamhnama ngthu sang hükie.<verse eid="ACT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Acunsepi, avange cun Kuparuh mlüh ja Kuriniha kaea kyakie, acune naw Antiok mlüh ami pha üng, khyangmjükcee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khyangmjükcee; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Krik pyenkia Judahe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Krik pyenkia khyange.</char></note> veia pi ngthu pyen u lü, Bawipa Jesuha thangkdaw ami sang.<verse eid="ACT 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Bawipa johit naw jah vepüi se; khyang khawhah naw jum u lü, Bawipa veia nghlat law päihkie.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ami mawngma cun Jerusalema veki sangcim naw ngja u lü, Banabah cun Antiok mlüha ami tüih.<verse eid="ACT 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Banabah a va pha üng, Pamhnama jah pet dawkyanak hmu lü aktäa jeki, ktha na kcang u lü Bawipa üng anglät se ami khäng vaia ami van a jah mcäi.<verse eid="ACT 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Banabah cun khyang kdawa kya lü, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ja jumeinak am bekia kyase, Bawipa veia khyang khawhah ngdawn lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Acunüng, Banabah cun Sawluh sui khaia Tasuh mlüha citki.<verse eid="ACT 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Va hmu lü Antiok mlüha a cehpüi. Kum mät bang Sangcim üng veki khyange am hmu hnga ni lü, khyang khawha ja mtheimthangki xawi. Acuna Antiok mlüha jumeikie cun “Khritjane” tia ami jah sui law kcüka kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Acuna kcün üng, sahma avange cun Jerusalem üngka naw Antioka ju citkie.<verse eid="ACT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:10">Ngs 21:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amimi üngka mat, Akabas ngming naki ngdüi law lü khawmdek khan avan üng khawjaw law khai tia Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am a pyen; acuna khawjawnak cun Ketah sangpuxang Kalawdih naw a jah upa kcün üng pha lawki.<verse eid="ACT 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Axüsawe naw ami khyaih khawha, Judah khawa vekiea jumeikie cun ja kpüikpak vaia ami mkhyah u.<verse eid="ACT 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Acukba ami büa mäiha ami ja kpüikpaknak cun Banabah ja Sawluha kut üngka naw, sangcim ngvaiea veia ami jah kbi.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mkhuimkhanak khawhah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Acun üng, sangpuxang Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sangpuxang Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Akaripa I, Palestin upki.</char></note> naw sangcime üngka avange jah mkhuimkha khaia büki. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Ani naw Johana be Jakop cun kcim am a hnim.<verse eid="ACT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Acun naw Judahe jah jesaki tia ksing lü Pita pi a va man. (Acuna mhnüp cun nghngen am bawikia muk pawhnaka mhnüpa kyaki).<verse eid="ACT 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ex 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng Pita man lü thawngim üng ami khyum, yekap xaleikhyuk am a jah ngängsak; kphyawnpawi a päng üng khyangea veia a cehpüi vaia tängki.<verse eid="ACT 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Acunakyase, Pita cun thawngim üng a tak ham; acunüngpi, sangcime naw Pita cun Pamhnama veia aktäa ami ktaiyü pet.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thawngim üngka naw Pita lätki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Herod naw Pita cun khyange vei am lawpüi hama mthan üng, Pita cun yekap nghngih xawia ani keh üng, mthiyüi nghngih am khit u se ipki; K'äihkie naw pi mkawt peia ve u lü mtätkie.<verse eid="ACT 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Acunüng, Bawipaa khankhawngsä mat ngdang law se, thawngim vai lawki. Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw Pita a kphyeng üng va ksün lü, “Akjanga tho lawa” a ti. Acunüng mthiyüie cun a kut üngka naw nghawk lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw, “Na khapat vawh lü, na khawdawk ngcuma” a ti. Acunüng, Pita naw acukba a pawh. Acunüng, khankhawngsä naw, “Na suisake jih lü, na läk law” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Pita naw kco law lü a läk; khankhawngsäa bilaw cun akcanga am sui lü a ngmanga a ngaih.<verse eid="ACT 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Ngäng kcükie ja anghninaka ngängkie a jah hei khe käna, khawk kpunga luhnak vaia mthiksawh va phaki. Acunüng ksawh amät nghmawng law se, lut law u lü lam mat üng ami va ceh üng, khankhawngsä naw Pita cun a cehtak.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Pita naw a ngsüm law ja, “Bawipa naw khankhawngsä tüi law lü, Heroda kut ja Judah khyangea äpeinak üngka naw, a na küikyan akcanga ka ksingki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Acunüng, ngaikyu khap lü, Makuh ngming naki, Johana nu Mariha ima va citki. Acua ktaiyü u lü khyang khawha a na ngkhämkie.<verse eid="ACT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Pita naw ksawh a khawk ja Rode ngming naki mpya naw ngai khaia va citki.<verse eid="ACT 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Pitaa kthai a ngjak üng jekyai ngen lü, ksawh pi käh mhmawng lü im k'uma va dawng beki naw, Pita ksawh peia ngdüiki tia a jah va mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Acunsepi, amimi naw, “Ng’yaw veki” ami na ti. Acunüng, ani naw, “Pita kcang ni” ti lü a pyen. Amimi naw, “Pitaa khankhawngsä va ni vü” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Acunsepi, Pita naw, khawk law laihlaih se, ami hmawn üng ta Pita hmu u lü aktäa cäi lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Acunüng, Pita naw, käh ami khihkheh vaia a kut üng ja kha lü, Bawipa naw thawngim üngka naw a mhlät bea mawng cun a jah mtheh. Acunüng, “Hina ngthu hin, Jakuk ja jumeikie üng jah va mtheh ua” a ti. Acunüng, va kco lü akcea citki.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Khaw athaih law ja, yekape cun, “Pita hawa veki ni?” ti u lü aktäa ami lu cingki.<verse eid="ACT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herod naw Pita a jah suisak, am hmu u. Ngängkie cun jah kthäh lü jah hnim vaia ngthu a jah pet. Acun käna Herod cun Judah khaw üngka naw Ketarih mlüha ju cit lü acua veki.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heroda a thiha mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Turah ja Sidon khaw khyangea khana aktäa a mlung thüi se veki; acunüng, anini naw bawi im ngängkia khyang, Balatuh cun püi nakie naw, atänga law u lü ngkhawt vaia ami nghuinak, isetiakyaküng, anini cun sangpuxanga khaw üngka eiawk vai ami yaha phäha kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Ami xünaka mhnüp üng Herod cun a bawijih jah suisa lü a bawingawhnak üng ngaw lü ami veia ngthu pyenki.<verse eid="ACT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Acunüng, khyang naküt naw, “Pamhnama kthai ni, nghngicima kthaia am kya naw” ti u lü ngpyangkie.<verse eid="ACT 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Ani naw Pamhnama am leisawngkia kyase, Bawipa khankhawngsä naw kpai se, mkyüt naw ei se thiki.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnama ngthu cun ngthang hü dämdämki.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Banabah ja Sawluh naw khüibi ani bilaw päng üng, Jerusalem üngkhyüh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">üngkhyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avange üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">vai.</char></note> naw nghlat be ni lü Johan, a ngming kce Makuh ngming naki cun ani hlawnga ani cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Banabah ja Sawluh jah xü lü ami jah tüih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Antiok mlüha sangcime üngka, sahmae ja sajae vekie; acune cun Banabah, Simeon (Khyang le), (Kurinih) khawa ka Lucia, (Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipah, Kalile upki (Bük Lk 3:1)</char></note> jah upnakia dä däm lawkia) Manin ja Sawluha kyakie.<verse eid="ACT 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Acunüng, Bawipaa khüibi bi u lü ami ei ami jeih k'um üng, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw, “Khutbi khai xawia ka jah mcawna Banabah ja Sawluh cun na jah phyäi hnga ua” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Ami ei jeih u lu ami ktaiyü law päng üng, ani khana ami kut mtaih u lü, ami ja tüih.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuparuh khawa phaki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw Banabahh ja Sawluh a jah tüihnak üng Selukih mlüha ju cit ni lü, acun üngka naw Kuparuh kawnga mlawng üng citki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Acunüng, Salamih mlüha ani pha üng, Judahea sinakoka Pamhnama ngthu pyenki xawi; Johan ami tia Makuh pi jah kpüi khaia ani cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Acuna kyawn avan üng cit hü ni lü, Papos cäpa cit hüki xawi; acunüng Judah khyang mat sui khyaihki a ngming Bar Jesuh naw kei sahmaki tiki ani hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Sekijah Pawluh cun Bar-Jesuh a nglawipüia kyaki. Sekijah Pawluh cun khyang kthema kya lü Papos kyawn upki kyaki. Ani naw Banabah ja Sawluh jah khü lü, Pamhnama ngthu ngai hlüki.<verse eid="ACT 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Acunsepi, sui khyaihki Eluma (Krik ngminga kyaki) naw jah upki cun am jumei khaia, angsä xawi a jah mah.<verse eid="ACT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Sawluh naki Pawluh ami ti naw, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am be lü, acuna Bar Jesuh cun büktengki naw,<verse eid="ACT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>“Nang khawyaia ca ni, nang cun dawkyanaka ye ni, kpyüpyehnak naküt am na beki, Bawipaa ngthukcange hleihlaka nghlatsak khai na ktha naki!<verse eid="ACT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>“Tukbäih Bawipa kut na khana pha lawki tia ksinga, khawkdei käh na hmu khaia na mik mü khai” a ti. Acun ja Eluma cun nghmüp naw jin se, a kut kha hü lü kaih khai suiki.<verse eid="ACT 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Acunüng, kyawn upki naw acun hmuh lü, Bawipa mawng mtheimthangnak cun müna lü aktäa kyühei lü jumeiki.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidih hne Antiok mlüh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Pawluh cun a ngkhahpüi xawi am, Papos üngka naw mlawng am cit u lü Pampulih hne Parkah mlüha pha u se, acunüng, Johan naki Makuh naw jah cehta lü, Jerusalem da nglat beki.<verse eid="ACT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Acunsepi, anini cun Parkah mlüh üngka naw cit laihlaih ni lü, Pisidih hne Antiok mlüh pha ni lü, acunüng, sabbath mhnüp üng sinakoka lut ni lü ngawki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Mosia Thume ja sahmaea cae ami khe law Päng üng, sinakok ngvaie naw, ani veia khyang tüih u lü, “Bena xawi aw, khyang nani jah mcäinak vaia ngthu a ve üng pyen nia” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Pawluh ngdüi law lü a kut säng lü, “Pamhnam kyühkia Isarele ja khyangmjükcee aw, ngai ua.<verse eid="ACT 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Ex 1:7</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ex 12:51</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hina Isarel khyangmjüe Pamhnam naw, mi pupae jah xü lü, khina kba Egypt pea ami ve üng khyangmjü kdäma a pawh. Pamhnam naw a themnak am Egypt pe üngkhyüh a jah lawpüi be.<verse eid="ACT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:34">Num 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Deut 1:31</ref></char>
    </note>Kum kphyükip khawkhyawng khawa a jah mcei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ani naw cuneiki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ani naw mceiki.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:1">Deut 7:1</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Jos 14:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kanan pea khyangmjü khyüh ja näng lü acun käna acuna pe cun Isarele am a jah kanaksak.<verse eid="ACT 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: a</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:16">Sk 2:16</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sam 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun käna, sahma Samuilah am a ve law ham üng, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Avan naw kum phyakphyü ja mhmakip. Acun käna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">kum phyakphyü ja mhmakip käna.</char></note>kum phyakphyü ja mhmakip ngthumkhyahkie am a jah na pet law.<verse eid="ACT 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Sam 8:5</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:21">1Sam 10:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun käna sangpuxang mso u se, Benjamina mjü üngka Kisah a cakpa Sawluh ngming naki, khawkum kphyükip ami sangpuxang vaia Pamhnam naw a jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 13:14">1Sam 13:14</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:12">1Sam 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Sal 89:20</ref></char>
    </note>Acun käna ani ksät lü Isarelea sangpuxang vaia Davit a mcawn be; Pamhnam naw cuna mawng cun ngsingsak lü, ‘Jisea cakpa, Davit, ka mlunga mäi mlung naki hmu veng, ani naw ka ngjakhlü naküt bi khai’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Pamhnam naw khyütam a jah peta mäiha, Isarele jah küikyan khai Davita mjü üngka Jesuh a jah pet,<verse eid="ACT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Lk 3:3</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw khutbi, am a tünei law ham üng, Johan naw ami mkhyekatnak nglata u lü baptican ami khan vaia Isarel khyangea veia ngthu a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mk 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Lk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Jn 1:27</ref></char>
    </note>Johana khut binak a päih law hlü üng, Johan naw, ‘U a nami na ngaiki ni? Kei nami ngäng ua am kya nawng. Acunsepi, ngai u, ka hnua law khai khyang ta, kei naw ania khawdawk suh pet khaia pi am nglawi veng’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>Abrahama mjü üngka ka püi Isarel khyange ja, hin üng Pamhnam hjawkhah khyangmjükcee aw, hina küikyannaka ngthu cun mi veia a jah kbi lawa kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Jerusalem mlüha vekie ja ami ngvaie naw, Jesuh cun küikyanaka Bawia, am ami ksinga phäha ja sahmaea ngthu sabbath mhnüp naküt üng ami kheh cun am ami ksinga phäha, acuna ngthue cun Jesuh ami mkat üng kümbesakie.<verse eid="ACT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mt 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mk 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Lk 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Jn 19:15</ref></char>
    </note>A thihnak vai i am hmu u lüpi, Pilata veia hnim vaia msokie.<verse eid="ACT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, a mawng sahmae naküt naw ami yuk, ami kümsak käna, kutlamktung üngka naw khya u lü lungdüa ami k’ut.<verse eid="ACT 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw thihnak üngka naw a mthawh be.<verse eid="ACT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:3">Ngs 1:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun käna Kalile üngka naw, Jerusalema a jah cehpüi khyangea veia khaw mhnüp khawvei ngdang be se, acune cun atuh Isarel khyangea veia saksikiea kyakie.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32-33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sal 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Keini naw pi, mi pupaea veia khyütam, thangkdaw ka ning jah mtheh lawki ni, acukba Pamhnam naw Jesuh a mthawh benak am, hina khyütam mi cae üng kümsakki, Salan anghnginak üng pi, ‘Nang ka ning cakpaa na kyaki; tungawi na paa ka kyaki’ tia ng’yuki.<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Hesa 55:3</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Ng’uh hnüna thukyawnaka käh cit khaia Pamhnam naw ani cun thihnak üngka naw a mthawh be vaia ngthu cun hikba a pyen, ‘Davita veia ngcimcaih lü ngsingkia dawkyanak cän nang üng ka ning pet khai’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sal 16:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunakyase, Salan kce üng pi, ‘Sitihki na mpya a thukyaw vai am tängki’ a ti sih.<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Davit pi, a xün k'um üng Pamhnama ngjakhlü bi a bi käna, thi se, a pupaea hlawnga k’ut u se, lungdüa kyaw pängki ni.<verse eid="ACT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw thihnak üngkhyüh amthawh be cun acukba am kya.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>Acunakyase, ka püi Isarele aw, acuna Bawi Jesuh üng mkhyekat mhlätnaka ngthu kami pyen law hin nami ksing vai hlüei veng. Mosi naw am a ning jah mhlät khawh mkhye üngkhyüh ani jumeiki avan cun jah mhlät khawhki.<verse eid="ACT 13:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Au pi ani jumeiki naküt cun Mosia thum naw, am a mhlät thei pi mhlät khai.<verse eid="ACT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Acunakyase, sahmae naw ami pyen cän nami khana käh apha law vaia mcei ua.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cangcim avang üng am ve</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nanga vei.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb 1:5</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Acun cun, ‘Hleihlakkie aw, bükteng ua, cäicing u lü thi ua; bi mat ka kpäng, acun cun khyang naw ning jah mtheh u sepi, nami xüna küt üng am jum uki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Pawluh ja Banabah cun Sinakok üngka naw ani lu law be üng, khyange naw, acuna ngthu cun sabbath bekce üng pi ani pyen be vaia ami jah nghuinak.<verse eid="ACT 13:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Ngkhämkie ami ngpyen be ja, Judahea ja Judah thuma ngpyawtkie khyangmjükcee naw Pawluh ja Banabah jah läk u se, Pamhnama bäkhäknak üng ami ve nglät vaia jah mcäiki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Acunüng, sabbath betü üng, Bawipaa ngthu ngai khaiea, mlüh üngka avan lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Acunsepi, Judahe naw khyange ami jah hmuh üng, aktäa jah cawkei u lü, Pawluha a ngthu pyen cun ngcuhpüi u lü ami ksenak.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Acunüng, Pawluh ja Banabah naw ling ni lü, “Pamhnama ngthu nangmia veia pyen ma vaia kya kungki; acunsepi, mah u lü anglät xünnak am nami yah vaia nami pawha kya se, Pamhnama a jah ah mcäia mäiha khyangmjükceea veia ning jah nghlatak ve ning.<verse eid="ACT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Hesa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char>
    </note>Acukba Bawipa naw ngthu a na pet cun, ‘Khawmdeka khütnak cäpa küikyanak na bi khaia, khyangmjükceea phäha akvaia ka ning mcawnki’ tia, kyaki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Acunüng, khyangmjükcee naw acuna ngthu ami ngjak üng je u lü Bawipaa ngthu mhlünmtaikie; acunüng, angläta xüng khaia a xü naküt naw jumkie.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Bawipa ngthu cun acuna khaw avan üng ngthang päihki.<verse eid="ACT 13:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Acunsepi, Judahe naw mlüh ngvaie ja Pamhnam hjawkhahki khyangmjükcee üngka nghnumie ami jah ksük. Ami naw Pawluh ja Banabah jah khuimkhasak u lü acuna khaw üngka naw ami jah ksät.<verse eid="ACT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mt 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mk 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Lk 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, ngsä xawi naw ani khawpha üngka mput cun khawk hüt ni lü Ikonih khawa citki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Antioka vekia jumeikie cun jekyainak ja Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am bekie.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ikonih mlüha citki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ikoniha pi acukba thawnki, Pawluh ja Banabah cun Ikonih khaw sinakoka lut ni lü ngthu pyen ni se, Judahe ja khyangmjükce khawha naw jumei lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Acunsepi, am jumei hlükiea Judahe naw khyangmjükcee jah ksük u lü, ami cun ami jah hnengsak.<verse eid="ACT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Acunakyase, Bawipa üng lingnak am ngthu pyen ni lü, acua khawvei ve ni se, Bawipa naw müncamnak ja cäi phyaki he cun ani kut am jah pawhsak lü, a bänaka ngthu a jah ksingsak.<verse eid="ACT 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Acunsepi, acuna khaw üngkae cun ngpai u lü, avang cun Judahea phäh, avang naw angsä xawia phäh kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Acunüng, khyangmjükcee, Judahe ja ami ngvaie naw angsä xawi cun ani hmai se khaia jah pawh u lü, lung am ami jah vawi vaia ami bü law üng,<verse eid="ACT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>acun ksingei law ni lü, Luhkonih mlüh üng Luhtarah ja Derbe ngnam ja a peia ngnamea dawngki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Acua thangkdaw cun sang hü laihlaihki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhtarah ja Derbea ngthu pyenki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Luhtarah khawa a hmi law üng tün lü a khaw xokia khyang, am cit hü theiki mat veki.<verse eid="ACT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Acuna khyang naw Pawluha a ngthu pyen ngai se, acunüng, Pawluh naw ani cun bükteng kyet lü a dawnak be vaia jumnak taki ti ksingki naw,<verse eid="ACT 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>angsanga, “Na khaw am angsunga ngdüi lawa” ti se, ani cun ngtawp law lü, cit lawki.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Khyange naw Pawluha a bilaw hmu u lü, Luhkonih khyü üng, angsanga ngpyang lü, “Mhname cun nghngicima mäiha mi veia kyum law ve u!” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Banabah cun, “Zutah” tia sui u lü, Pawluh cun ngthu pyenki kyase, “Harmes” tia ami sui.<verse eid="ACT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Acuna khaw peia vekia Zutah mhnama ktaiyü naw mlüh kpung üngkhyüh se ja paipaie cun luhnaka mkawt peia jah lawpüi lü khyange am ngsä xawia phäh ngkengtainak vaia pawh khaiea ngtängkie.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Acunsepi, Banabah ja Pawluh naw, acun ani ksing law ja, ani suisak ja ktek ni lü, khyangea ksunga dawng ni lü ngpyangki xawi naw,<verse eid="ACT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:11">Ex 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Sal 146:6</ref></char>
    </note>“Khyange aw, hin hin ivai nami pawhki ni? Keini pi nangmia mäiha nghngicima kani kyaki ni; nangmi naw amdange jah hawih u lü, mce ja khankhaw, tui acunüng veki naküt jah mhnün lü, anglät se xüngkia Pamhnama veia nami nghlat lawnak vaia thangkdaw kani ning jah mtheh lawki ni.<verse eid="ACT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Acuna Pamhnam naw ajana khyang naküt amimäta lam üng cit khaiea a jah tüih,<verse eid="ACT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>acunsepi, nami khana abänak am eiawk phübe u lü nami jekyai vaia, khankhawa ka naw khaw ak lawsak lü kthiktheih yawpaia dawnak khawkum a ning jah pet ni. Acuna Pamhnam veki tia ngsingsaki” tia ani pyen.<verse eid="ACT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Acukba pyen lü ami ngkengtainak vaia ami hnim hlü cun ngyan üng ani jah pyaisak.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Acunsepi, Antiok mlüh, pisidih hne ja Ikonih mlüh üngka Judahe avang acua law hngakie naw, khyange jah ksük u se; acuna Pawluh cun lung üng ami khawng, thikia sui u lü mlüh kpunga jäk u lü ami cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Acunsepi, jumeikie naw ami kcung law ja, Pawluh cun tho law lü mlüh k'uma cit beki. A ngawi üng, ani cun Banabah am Derbe khawa citki.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siria pe Antioka ani nghlat law bea mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Acuna hne üng thangkdaw pyen ni lü, axüisawe khawha ani jah yah käna, Luhtarah, Ikonih ja, Pisidih hne, Antiok mlüha nghlat be ni lü,<verse eid="ACT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>“Khuikhatnak khawhah khamei lü, Pamhnama pe mi lut khaia kya kungki” tia, jumeikiea mlung ja khängsak ni lü, jumeinak üng ami khängcek vaia ani ja mcäi.<verse eid="ACT 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Sangcim naküt üng ngvaie jah mcawn pet ni lü, ei jeih u lü ami ktaiyü law päng üng Bawipa ami ümnak vaia ami jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Pisidih hne avan üng cit hü ni lü, Pampulih hnea phaki xawi. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Parkah khawa ngthu ani sang päng üng, Ataliha citki xawi. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Acunüngka naw mlawng am cit ni lü, Antiok pha law beki xawi, acun cun ani bilawh binak üng Pamhnama mpyeneinak ani yah vaia jah ap ni lü ami jah tüihnaka khawa kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Antiok ani pha ja sangcime jah ngkhämsak ni lü Pamhnam naw jah summangei lü khut ani bi naküte ja, khyangmjükcee phäha pi jumnaka ksawh a mhmawnga mawng cun ani jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Acunüng, jumeikiea veia khawvei veki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jerusalema ngcunnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Khyang avange cun Judah khaw üngka naw Antioka law u lü, “Mosia thuma mäiha nami vun am nami mawih üng küikyannak am nami yah khai” tia, jumeikie ami jah mthei.<verse eid="ACT 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Acune am Pawluh ja Banabah cun aktäa ngcuh u se, Pawluh ja Banabah cun angsä avange am, acuna ngthua phäha, Jerusalema vekiea Ngsäe ja sangcim ngvaiea veia hang cit khaiea ami mkhyäp.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Sangcime naw jah tha u se, ani naw khyangmjükcee ami nghlat law bea mawng cun Phonisia ja Samarih avan üng cit hü ni lü ani pyena kyase, jumeikie naküt ani jah jesak.<verse eid="ACT 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Jerusalem ani jäng pha üng, sangcime, Ngsäe ja, sangcim ngvaie naw jah na je na u se, Pamhnam naw a jah summangei naküt ani jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Acunsepi, Pharisee üngka, jumeiki avange tho law u lü, “Khyangmjükcee naw ami vun ami mawi vaia kyaki, Mosia thum pi ami läk vaia jah mtheh vai” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Ngsäe ja sangcim ngvaie cun, acuna ngthu ngai khaiea ngcunkie.<verse eid="ACT 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Ngs 10:1-43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ami ngcuh käna Pita naw ngdüi law lü, “Benae aw, khyangmjükcee naw, keia üngkhyüha thangkdaw ngja u lü, jumei khaiea ajana Pamhnam naw nangmi üngkhyüh ana mcawn tia nami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:44">Ngs 10:44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">Ngs 2:4</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, mlung ksingkia Pamhnam naw mimi a jah peta mäiha, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim cun khyangmjükceea veia pi jah peki.<verse eid="ACT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Mimi ja amimi, mi hngalangnak am ve, jumeikiea kyase ami mkhyekatnak jah mhlätki.<verse eid="ACT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Acunakyase, mimi ja mi pupae naw pi am ami kpüieia phüi cun ivaia jumeikie am jah phüi hlüsak u lü, Pamhnam nami mhnüteiki ni?<verse eid="ACT 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Mimi cun pi amimia mäiha mi jum u lü, Bawi Jesuha bäkhäknak am küikyannak mi yahki” tia a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Khyange cun Banabah ja Pawluh naw, Pamhnam naw jah summangei se, khyangmjükceea veia müncamnak ja cäicatnake ani bilawha mawng, ani jah mtheh üng käh khikhe u lü, ngaikie.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Cunüng ani pyen law päng ja Jakuk naw pi pyen hnga lü, “Benae aw, ka pyen na ngai ua,<verse eid="ACT 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Pamhnam naw akcüka khyangmjükcee üngka, avange a phäha jah xü lü amimi jah bükteng khaia a lawa mawng cun, Sihmon naw ana pyen pänga kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Acuna ngthu cun sahmaea ngthu am tängki.<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Cangcim üng: ‘Acun käna nghlat be lü, Davita khaw ka pyang be khai, apyehnak naküt pi ka mdüi be khai;<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Khyang akcee ja khyangmjükcee, ka ngming am ka jah khüe naküt pi ka veia law khaie.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Khawmdeka ngtüi üng tün lü, hina ngthu jah mthehkia Bawipa naw ti ve’ tia pyenki.<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Acunakyase, khyangmjükcee üng, Pamhnama veia nghlat lawki he cun käh jah khuimkha u lü,<verse eid="ACT 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Ex 34:15-17</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Lev 18:6-23</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lev 17:10-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>juktuh üng pet, käh ngcimki eiawk, hüipawmnak, khisa käh sawi u lü hnim ja thi käh ami ei vaia, ami veia ca jah kbi üng daw khai tia ngai veng.<verse eid="ACT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Mosia thum cun sinakoka sabbath naküt üng khe khawia kya lü, mlüh naküt üng acuna ngthu cun sang päng kyaki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeiki khyangmjükceea veia ca ami ja kbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Ngsäe, angvaie ja sangcime naküt naw, mimi üngka khyang xü u lü, Pawluh ja Banabaha veia Antioka tüih üng daw khai ami ti; ami jah xüe cun ami jah leisawnga kyaki. Ami ngming cun, Judah ami ti Barsaba ja, Tilah a kyaki. Acun xawi cun jumeikie üng angvai xawia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Hikba ani xawi üng ca ami ja kbi cun, “Ngsäe ja benae üng sangcim ngvaie naw, Antiok, Siria khaw ja, Kilikih khawa vekiea khyangmjükcee, ning jah hnukset ve u.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Khyang avange naw, keimi naw am kami jah mtheha, keimi üngka naw law u lü, ‘Nangmi, nami vun nami mawi vai, thum nami läk vai’ tia, nami mlung ning jah bawngbaisakie tia ngja u lü,<verse eid="ACT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>mi Bawi Jesuha ngminga phäha Banabah ja Pawluh cun naw xünnak am mcehnaki xawi,<verse eid="ACT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>kami ja mhlänaka Banabah ja Pawluh,Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa phäh ami sak käh mceh naki xawi, atänga ja xü u lü, nami veia kami jah tüih law vaia kami jah tak,<verse eid="ACT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>ahina mawngma ning jah mtheh law khai xawia, Judah ja Tilah cun nami veia kami ja tüih law.<verse eid="ACT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ja keimi naw atänga, yühkia phüi cun nami khana mtai üng am daw khaia ngai ve üng,<verse eid="ACT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>juktuh peta eiawk, khisaa thi, kbüh lü hnima sa käh jah ei u lü hüipawmnak jah cehta ua; ahina ngkhaw nami jah cehtak üng ta nami phäha daw khai ni. Mya u lü ve u” tia ami yuk.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Acukba ami jah tüih cun cit ni lü, Antiok phaki xawi; acunüng, khyange jah khü ni lü, ca cun ani jah pet. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Ami khe law päng ja, ami ja mcäinaka ngthua phäha aktäa jekie. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Judah ja Tilah cun sahmaa pi kyaki xawia kya lü, ngthu khawha am, benae jah mcäi ni lü, khawvei ktha ani jah pet. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Acua khawvei ani ve käna, jah tüih lawki hea veia nghlat be khai xawia, benae naw dim’yenak am ami jah tüih be. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Acunsepi, Tilah cun amät ve hütki.<verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Pawluh ja Banabah cun Antiok khyang khawhah am ve yüm lü, Bawipa ngthu jah mtheimthang ni lü atänga veki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh ja Banabah ngtaiki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Khawveica angsawk law käna, Pawluh naw Banabaha veia, “Tuhkbäih ni cit be lü, Bawipa ngthu ni sangnaka khaw naküta bena vekie veia cit hü lü ami vecawh ni jah bükteng hü vai” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Banabah naw, Johan Makuh ami ti cun ani veia cehpüi vaia a täng, <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Ngs 13:13</ref></char></note>Pampulih khaw üngka naw ja hawih hüt lü, khüibi bi khaia ani hlawnga am cit hngakia kyase, Pawluh naw ta Makuh ani hlawng cehpüi vaia am jum.<verse eid="ACT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Acunakyase, aktäa ngcuhki xawi, ngtai law ni lü, Banabah naw Makuh cun a hlawnga cehpüi lü, Kuparuha mlawng am citki xawi. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Pawluh naw Tilah a xü; acunüng, jumeikie naw Bawipa bäkhäknak ami mcei vai ja ngthu ami jah pet. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Sangcime jah khäng hüsak lü Siria ja Kilikih khaw avan üng cit hüki.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Pawluh ja Tilah hlawnga Timoti citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Pawluh ja Tilah cun Derbe ja Luhtarah citki xawi; acua Timoti ngming naki khritjan mat veki; ani cun jumeikia Judah nghnumia cakpaa kyaki, a pa cun Krika kyaki;<verse eid="ACT 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Ani cun Luhtarah ja Ikoniha vekie naw jumeiki ti lü ania mawng cun pyenkie.<verse eid="ACT 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Pawluh naw ani cun ami hlawnga ami cehpüi vai a täng. Acunüng, acua vekiea Judahea phäha, a vun a mawihsak, a pa Krika kyaki tia ami van naw ami ksinga phäha kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Mlüh naküt üng cit hü ni lü, Jerusalema angvaie ja ngsä he naw ami mkhyaha jah läklam vaie cun jumeikie üng ani jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Sangcime cun jumnak üng khäng u lü a mhnüp tä se nung law dämdämkie.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tarosa Pawluh naw ngdamnak a hmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw Asah hne ngthu sang vai am ti se, Pharikih hne ja Kalatih hne avan üng cit hüki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Mutih ng'yü pei ani pha law ja, Bithunih hnea lut khai xawia büki xawi, acunsepi, Jesuha Ngmüimkhya naw am a jah cehsak.<verse eid="ACT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Mutih khe ni lü, Taros da<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kdungkie; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">khe lü.</char></note> citki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Mthana Pawluh naw mdannak üng Maketawniha khawa ka khyang mat ngdüi lü, “Maketawniha khawa law lü, jah kpüi lawa” tia, nghui na se a hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Acuna mdannak a hmuh law päng ja, ami veia thangkdaw pyen khaia Pamhnam naw jah khüki tia ksing ni lü, Maketawniha hnea ceh vaia kami ngtünki.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philipiha Lidia naw küikyanak a yaha mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Taros üngkhyüh mlawng am cit u lü, Samotarat kami citki, angawi üng Nepoliha kami cit be tüki;<verse eid="ACT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Acun üngka naw Philipih mlüha kami citki, acuna mlüh cun Maketawniha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maketawniha mlüh ktung,</char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maketawih üng mlüh kyäp bawk</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maketawniha mlüh daw</char></note> khaw üng mlüh mata kya lü, Romah mlüh ktung üngkaa kyaki. Acuna khaw üng khawvei kami veki.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Sabbath mhnüp üng, khaw kpunga cit u lü, tui caye da, Judahea ktaiyünaka hnüna vekia kami ngaih. Acua ngaw lü, ngbäm lawki hea nghnumie veia ngthu kami pyenki.<verse eid="ACT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Acunüng, Lidia ngming naki, jihsen jawiki, Tuhtirah khawa ka, Pamhnam jumkia nghnumi mat naw kami ngthu ngja lü, Pawluha ngthu pyen cun aktäa ngai khaia Bawipa naw a mlung a mhmawng.<verse eid="ACT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>A im khyawng avan naw Baptican ami khan law päng üng, “Bawipa jumei kcangkia nami na ngaih üng ka ima kai law ua” tia, jah nghui na lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philipiha Thawngim üng ami jah khyum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Mhnüp at üng ktaiyünaka hnüna kami ceh k'um üng, mpya nghnumica mat malam pyen lü ngjoki kami khyum. Acuna nghnumica cun Ngmüimkhya kse naw a mahpa phäh malam pyen lü ngui khawh yahki.<verse eid="ACT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Acun naw Pawluh ja keimi jah läk law lü, “Hina küikyannaka lam ning ja mtheh lawki he cän hlüngsäihki Pamhnama mpyae ni” ti lü, ngpyangki.<verse eid="ACT 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Acukba khaw mhnüp khawvei veki. Acukba kyase Pawluh naw am ngja law hlü lü, nghlat sihki naw, Ngmüimkhya kse üng, “Jesuh Khritawa ngming am ka ning mthehki, a k'um üngka naw lut law” a ti ja lut lawki.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Acunüng, a mahpae naw, ami ngui suinak päihki tia ksing law u lü, Pawluh ja Tilah jah man u lü, khyang ngkhämnak, angvaiea veia ami jah cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Romah Bawiea veia ja cehpüi u lü, “Hi xawi hin Judah khyang xawia kyaki xawi, kami mlüh jah khuimkha lawki xawi,<verse eid="ACT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Ami naw mi thum kpetki thumcam jah mtheikie. Mimi cun Romah khyanga mi kyaki. Amimia bilawh cun am mi läk dat vaia thum pyeni xawi” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Acunüng khyange cun Pawluh ja Tilah jah pawh khaiea ngkhäm law hngakie, bawie naw ani kcu ja suisak u lü, cung am jah kpai vaia ngthu ami jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Khawvei ami jah kpai päng lü, thawngima ja khyumkie naw, thawng ngvai naw ngängki am, üp ye khaia a ngäng vaia ami jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Acukba mtheh u se, thawngim ngvai naw, thawngima ak'um säisäiha ja khyumki naw, ani khaw cun khyaw üng a jah khun.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh ja Tilah cun, mthana Pamhnama veia ktaiyü ni lü, ng’äi mcuk ni se, thawngim üng kyum hngakie naw ami jah ngaih.<verse eid="ACT 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Angxita ngkhyü ngsün law se, thawngima hnün pi ngsün lawki; acunüng, ksawh naküt nghmawng law se, khyange ami jah khihnake cun ngsutei law päihkie.<verse eid="ACT 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Thawng ngvai cun a ihnak üngkhyüh tho lawki, thawngim ksawhe nghmawng u se jah hmu lü, thawng kyume dawng päikiea ngai lü, a kcim lo lü hnimei khaia ngtängki.<verse eid="ACT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh naw, ngpyang lü, “Käh thawna; kami van hia kami veki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Thawng ngvai naw meikdäi akjanga jah kthäh lü, kyühei lü ngkhyet lü, Pawluh ja Tilaha hmaia kawpki.<verse eid="ACT 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Kpunga jah cehpüi lü, “Saja xawi aw, küikyannak ka yah vaia i ka pawh khai?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Ani xawi naw, “Bawipa Jesuh jumeia, acunüng, namät ja na khuiim khyawng lawnge maha küikyannak nami yah khai” ani ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Acunüng, a veia ja, a ima vekie naküta veia Bawipaa ngthu ani pyen.<verse eid="ACT 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Acuna mthan, acun naji üng jah cehpüi lü, ami jah kpainaka ani nghmae cun a jah mthih pet; acunüng, amät ja a khuiim khyawng lawng ami ngkhä Baptican khankie.<verse eid="ACT 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>A ima ja cehpüiki naw, jah khin na lü, Pamhnam ami jumei lawa phäha, amät cun a khuiim khyawng lawng ami van am aktäa jekie.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Khaw a thaih law ja, Romah bawie naw, “Acun xawi jah khyah ua” tia, jee ami jah tüih.<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Acunüng, thawng ngvai naw, Pawluha veia, “Bawie naw, ning ja hlät khaiea, khyang jah tüi lawki he ni; acunakyase, atuh lut law ni lü, dim’yenak am cit nia” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh naw, “Romah khyanga kami kyaki, kami mkhyenak am ve xaki ami jah kpai u, thawngim üng ami jah khyum; atuh anghmüa jah ktäm khaiea bükie aw? Acukba am kya sawxat khai; amimät Romah ngvaie law u lü, jah hlät law u se” tia, je ngvai ani jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Je ngvai naw, acuna ngthu cun Romah ngvaie ami jah mtheh; acunüng, Romah khyanga kyaki xawi tia jah ksing law u lü, kyühei lawki he naw;<verse eid="ACT 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>va cit u lü, ja mcäikie naw, jah nghui na be u lü, thawng üngka naw jah hlät u lü mlüh cun ani cehtak vaia ami jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 16:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Acunüng, thawngim üngka naw lut law ni lü, Lidia ima citki xawi; jumeikie jah hmu ni lü, jah dim’yesak ni lü, cit beki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Thesalonikah mlüha citki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Pawluh ja Tilah cun Amphipolih ja Apolonih jah khe pah lü, Thesalonikah mlüha Judahea sinakoka venaka citki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Acua Pawluh cun a thum khawia mäiha, ami veia lut lü, Sabbath mhnüp kthum vei, khyange mahmah ngthäh ngkhyah u lü pyen u lü, Cangcim üngka jah mtheh lü,<verse eid="ACT 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Mesijah naw khuikhanak khamei khaia akyaka mawng, thinak üngkhyüh a tho be vaia mawng cun jah mthehki. “Hina Jesuh ka ning jah mtheh cun Mesijaha kyaki ni” ti lü Pawluh naw a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Avang he naw jum u lü, Krik khyang khawhae ja nghnumi khawhae naw Pawluh ja Tilaha veia law u lü Mhnam mküimto lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Acunsepi, Judahe naw, k’eihei u lü, lama i käh pawhkie cun jah lawpüi u lü khyange jah ngcun lawsakie naw, mlüh avan üng suksak lawki he. Acunüng, Jasona ima ngkhäm law u lü, Pawluh ja Tilah cun khyangea hmaia ami jah cehpüi vaia ami täng.<verse eid="ACT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Am jah hmu u lü, Jason ja jumeikie cun khyang ngvaiea hmaia jah kaihkie naw, ngpyang u lü, “Hina khyange naw avan suksak khaia Khawmdek nglatsakie cun mi mlüha lawki he;<verse eid="ACT 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Jason naw jah na khin na ve, ahin xawi cun, ‘Jesuh ngming naki, sangpuxang kce veki tia, Emperoa thum am läk ni” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Acuna khyange naw mlüh ngvaie cun ami jah suksakei;<verse eid="ACT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Jason ja a püie cun ngui jah tä lü jah hlät lü ami jah cehsak be.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Berih mlüha phaki xawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Jumeikie naw mthana, Pawluh ja Tilah cun Beriha jah cehsak u se; acua ami va pha ja, Judahea sinakoka lutki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Acuna khaw khyange cun, Thesalonikah mlüh khyangea kthaka ana daw u se, mlung jenak am ngthu cun dokhameikie, ani ngthu pyen cun am akcang ja akcang ksingnak vaia, a mhnüp tä se, Cangcim cun büktengkie.<verse eid="ACT 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Acunakyase, khyang khawha naw jum u se; Krik nghnumi kdawe ja kpamie naw pi jum lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Acunsepi, Thesalonikah mlüha ka Judahe naw, Pawluh naw Berih mlüha pi Pamhnama ngthu sangki tia ami ksing üng, acua pi va cit u lü, khyange ami jah va ksük.<verse eid="ACT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Jumeikie naw, Pawluh cun tui cayea cit khaia ami tüih. Acunsepi, Tilah ja Timoti cun acua ve hütki xawi.<verse eid="ACT 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Pawluh va thakie naw, Aten mlüh cäpa cit u lü Berih da nglat law be lü Pawluh naw a jah cüka kba, Tilah ja Timoti cun naw akjanga a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aten mlüha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Pawluh naw Atena Tilah ja Timoti jah k'äih lü a ve üng, mlüh cun juktuhe am be lü a hmuha kyase, aktäa a mlung am daw.<verse eid="ACT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Acunüng, sinakoka Judahe ja Pamhnam jumkie khyangmjükcee jah pyenpüi lü, khyang ami ngkhämnaka law nakütkia veia a mhnüp tä se a jah pyenpüi.<verse eid="ACT 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Epikurih ja, Stok sajae naw ani ngcuhpüikie. Avang he naw, “Hin ia am ngtäh xaki naw i pyen hlüki ni?” ami ti. Avang he naw, Jesuha mawng ja thawhnak bea mawng a pyena phäha, “Pe kcea ka mhnama mawng pyenki am ni aw” ami ti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jesuh ja thawhnak be: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Krik üng “thawhnak be” hin naw mhnam nghnumia ngminga kyaki tia ksing phyaki.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Pawluh cun man u lü, mlüh kawngci, Arepakaha hmaia lawpüi u lü, “Hina mtheimthangnak akthai na pyen hü hin na jah ksingsak thei khai aw?<verse eid="ACT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Akthai am kami ngjak khawi cun na sang lawki ni; acunakyase, acuna suilam kami ksing vai täng ve üng” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Aten mlüha khyange ja khine cun, ngthu kthaia akyak üng, ami pyen vai ja ami ngaih vaia phäha ami kcün sumeiki he.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Pawluh cun kawngci hmaia ngdüi lü, “Nangmi Aten khyange cun, a naküt üng jumnak aktäa nami taki ti ka ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Ka ceh hü sawa, nami hjawkhahe ka ja bükteng üng, kpyawngkung mata khana, ‘Am ksinga Mhnama phäha’ ti lü ng’yuki ka hmuh. Acunakyase, am ksing u lü nami jumei, acuna mawng ka ning jah mthehki ni.<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24,25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Sang 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Hesa 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Ngs 7:48</ref></char>
    </note>Pamhnam, khawmdek ja a k'uma veki naküt ja mhnünki cun, mce ja khana Bawia kyase kut am saka temple üng am ve.<verse eid="ACT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Khut bi lü a hlüei cun mi pe khai aw, amät kung cun anaküt am xünnak, ngxünak a naküt üng pekia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Acunüng, khawmdek khan naküt üng ve khaia, khyang mat üngka naw khyang mjüe naküt atäng tänga jah mhnün lü, ami phäha akcün ja ami venak vai phäh phähe pi a jah tak pet.<verse eid="ACT 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnam cun ami hmuh vaia sui hükie; acunsepi, Pamhnam cun mimi üngkhyüh akthuka am ve.<verse eid="ACT 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Amäta phäha mi xüng lü, mi thoawm lü mi veki; ‘Keimi pi Mhnama a jah caea kami kyaki’ tia nangmi üng khyang mat naw pyenki.<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Acukba Pamhnama caea mi kya ua phäha, nghngicima khyaihnak am pyanga xüie, nguie, lung he lup cun Mhnam am tänga käh jah ngaih vai.<verse eid="ACT 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Ahlana Pamhnam am ksing u se, jah na hawih khawi se pi, atuh cun ahawa pi ami mkhyekatnak nghlatak vaia ngthu a jah petki,<verse eid="ACT 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>akcün a na pyang päng thüp thüpa phäha, acuna mhnüp üng, a mcawna nghngicim phäh khawmdek avan cun angsunga ngthumkhyah law pe khai; acun cun Pamhnam naw thihnak üngka naw mtho be lü, khyange naküta veia angsingsak pänga kyaki” tia a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Acuna thihnak üngka naw mthawh bea ngthu Pawluh naw pyen se ami ngjak üng avange naw ami yaihei; avange naw, “Hina ngthu na pyen be vai ngja hlü ve üng” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Acunüng Pawluh naw ami ngkhyumnak a jah cehtak.<verse eid="ACT 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Acunsepi, khyang avange Pawluha veia ngdawn law u lü, jumei lawki he; acunüng avange cun, Dajonutih khyang kawngci üngkaa kya u lü avange cun nghnumi mat Damarih jah khyang kcea kyakie.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Korintuh mlüha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Acunüng Pawluh cun Aten mlüh üngka naw Korintuha citki.<verse eid="ACT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Acuia Akuilah ngming naki Judah khyang mat a hmuh, acun cun Pontasa hmikia kyaki. Sangpuxang Kalawdih naw Judahe naküt Romah hne üngka naw ami ceh vaia jah ktäm se, a khyu Priscilah am Itali üngka naw law thaiki xawia kyaki. Pawluh naw jah hmu khai citki.<verse eid="ACT 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Pawluh cun, acu xawia veia phaki, acunüng, ami bi tängkia kyase, ani veia ve lü, ani veia khüikawm hngaki; ami bi cun jih im saka kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Sabbath naküt üng sinakoka yet na kcang lü ngthu pyen khawi lü, Judahe ja Krike jah yah khaia büki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Tilah ja Timoti cun Maketawniha üngka naw pha law ni lü, Pawluh cun a kcün naküt üng Judahe veia Jesuh cun Mesijah ni ti lü ngthu jah mthehki.<verse eid="ACT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Acunsepi Judahe naw ma u lü ksenakiea kyase, Pawluh naw a suijih üngka mput kha lü ami veia, “Nami khyüh üng namimäta phäh ni, kei naw am mta na veng. Tuhkbäih khyangmjükceea veia ka cit khai” a ti. <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Acun üngka naw citki cun, Tihtuh Jastas ngming nakia ima phaki, acun cun Pamhnam jumki, a im pi sinakoka peia kyaki. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Acunüng, Kripuh, sinakoka ngvai naw, a khuiim khyawng lawng ami van naw Bawipa jumei law u se, Korintuh khyang khawhae naw pi ngja u lü jumei law hnga u lü, Baptican khankie.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Mthana Bawipa naw mdannak üng, Pawluha veia, “Käh kyühei lü, ngthu na pyen cän käh hjaüha;<verse eid="ACT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>kei na hlawnga ka veki ni, ning hui khaia u naw am ning pawh; hina mlüh üng, ka khyang khawha ka taki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Pawluh cun, acua ami veia Pamhnama ngthu jah mthei lü, kum mät ja khya khyuk veki.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Acunüng, Kalio, Akaijah mlüha sangpuxang Romah naw a mcawn üng, Judahe naw atänga Pawluh man u lü, junga cehpüikie.<verse eid="ACT 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>“Hin khyang naw, käh nglawi khaia Mhnam jum vaia khyang ksük lü thum lümkanki” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Pawluh naw a pyen law hlü üng, Kalio naw Judahea veia, “Judahe aw, hin hin am dawki ja mkhyekatnak a pawh a nia ta, acinglinga ka ning jah ngaih pet vai sü;<verse eid="ACT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>acunsepi, ngthu nami ngcuh, ngming he ja nami thumea ngkhawa kya üng ta, namimät naw pyensa ua; kei acuna ngkhaw ka cijang vai am täng veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Acunüng, jung üngka naw, ami van a jah ksät.<verse eid="ACT 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Krike naw, sinakok ngvai Soten mankie naw, junga maa kpai u se, Kalio naw acun cun ia pi am ngai.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok mlüha nghlat bekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Num 6:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun käna Pawluh cun khawvei ve lü; acun käna Korintuha jumeikie cun thangkdaw am jah ngtaipüi lü, acun üngka naw Siria da mlawng am citki, a veia Priscilah ja Akuilah cit hngaki xawi; Pawluh naw ajana sitih ana taka mäiha Kenkirih mlüha a lusam kteih petki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ng’yünnak ani naw a pawh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahin cun Judahea thum üng lu kteih lü ng'yünnak cun läk yahkie.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Ephet mlüha pha u se, acua anini cun jah hawih hüt lü, amät sinakoka k'uma lut lü, Judahea jah ngthähngkhyah püiki.<verse eid="ACT 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Khawvei ve khaia ami nghuinak, acunsepi am yü.<verse eid="ACT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>“Pamhnam naw a hlüeia akyak üng nami veia ka law be khai ni” tia, thangkdaw am jah ngtaipüi lü, Ephet üngka naw mlawng am citki.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Ketarih a pha üng, Jerusalema jäng cit lü, sangcime cun a jah hnukset; acun käna Antiok mlüha cit beki.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Acua khawvei a ve käna cit be lü, jumeikie ngjuktha jah pe lü, Kalatih hne ja Pharikih hne avan üng cit hüki.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apawluh Ephet mlüh ja Korintuh mlüha citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Judah khyang mat, Aleksandria mlüha hmiki, Apawluh ngming naki, Ephet mlüha lawki; ani cun pyensak yah lü Cangcim aktäa ksingkia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Ani cun Bawipa Mawnglam ngthei pängkia kya se, yet na kcang lü, Jesuha mawng kcang aktäa xena lü jah mtheimthangki, acun se pi Johana Baptican däk va ksingkia kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Acunüng, sinakoka lingnak kcang am ngthu pyen law se, acua Priscilah ja Akuilah naw a ngthu pyen ngja ni lü, ani ima khüki xawi naw, a veia Pamhnama Mawnglam cun ngsing ngai khaia ani mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Apawluh cun, Akaijah khawa cit khaia ngtängse, Epheta veki jumeikie naw ami na dokhamnak vaia, jumeikie naw ca yu u lü ami cehsak. Acunüng, a va pha üng Pamhnama bäkhäknak am jumeikie cun aktäa jah kpüikpaki.<verse eid="ACT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Jesuh cun Mesijaha kyaki tia mawng cun Judahe jah ngcuhngkaih püi lü Cangcim üngka jah mdang lü khyange aktäa a jah näng.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Ephet mlüha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Apawluh Korintuh mlüha a ve k'um üng, Pawluh cun pe k'uma ceh hü päng üng Epheta pha law lü, axüisawe avang a jah hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Ami veia, “Nami jumei law üng Ngmüimkhya Ngcim nami yahki aw?” a ti. Acunüng, amimi naw, “Ka; Ngmüimkhya Ngcim veki tia pi am ngja khawi u ngü” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Ani naw, “Ia Baptican ja nami khan?” a ti. Amimi naw, “Johana Baptican” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Lk 3:4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Jn 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char>
    </note>Pawluh naw, “Johana Baptican cun ami mkhye nglatakia phäh kyaki, ‘Johan naw Isarel khyange üng, ‘Ka hnua law khai cun nami jum vai, “Ani cun Jesuh ni” ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Acuna ngthu ami ngjak ja, Bawipa Jesuha ngming üng Baptican khankie.<verse eid="ACT 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pawluh naw, ami khana a kut mtai se, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ami khana pha lawki; acunüng, läk akce am ngthu pyen u lü, Mhnama mawng sangkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Ami vana kpami xaleinghngih lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Pawluh cun sinakoka k'uma lut lü, khya kthum üng yet lü ngthu pyenki, Pamhnama pea mawng cun khyange jah ngcuhpüi lü jah ksingsaki.<verse eid="ACT 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Acunsepi, avange cun ami mlung ngcang se, am jum u lü khyangea hmaia Bawipaa Mawnglam ami ksekhanak. Pawluh naw jah cehta lü, jumeikie akcea jah cehpüiki naw, amhnüp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üng ngpüiki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">11:00 ngawilam üngkhyüh 4:00 mülam cäpa.</char></note> tä se Turanah ima jah ngthähpüi lü jah mtheimthangki.<verse eid="ACT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Acukba kum nghngih jah mthei se, Asah hnea vekie naküt Judahe ja Krike naw pi Bawipa ngthu cun ngjakie.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sakevaha cakpae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Pamhnam naw Pawluh üngkhyüh müncam phyaki jah pawhki.<verse eid="ACT 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Acunüng, Pawluha pava ja a jih cum am khyaihki vei ami cehpüi, mnehmnange cun khyük u lü khawyaie pi ngsätkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Khawyai ksät hükie Judah avange naw, “Pawluh naw a pyen hü khawia Jesuha ngming am ning jah ksät ve üng” ti u lü, khawyaia venaka khyangea khana, Bawipa Jesuha ngming sumeiki he.<verse eid="ACT 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Judah khyang, ktaiyü ngvai säih mat, Sakevaha cakpa khyühe naw acukba pawh hlüki.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Acuna khawyai naw ami veia, “Jesuh ka ksingki, Pawluh pi ka ksingki, nangmi hin ue ni?” ti lü a jah kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Khawyaia venak naw, jah jawng law sih lü, ami van jah nängei se, acuna im üngkhyüh, lemkie kyase, ami suisak hawih hüt lü dawngkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Epheta vekia Judahe ja Krikea veia, acuna ngthu cun ngthang hüki; acunüng, avan kyüh hü u se, Bawipa Jesuha ngming mhlünmtai lü veki.<verse eid="ACT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Jumeikie khawhah law hü u lü, ami bilawhe cun khyang ksunga jah phyeh lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Ngjo khawhae naw pi, ami caupe jah lawpüi u lü, khyang ksunga ami jah mkhih law; acun üng, a phu täh u se, ngui thawng mhmakip phunakia ami ksing.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ngui kawin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngui kawin cun ngnama vekiea ami hlawhei kheha kyaki (Bük Mt 20.2)</char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Ahikba johit am be lü, Bawipaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hina ... Bawipa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa johita mawng.</char></note> ngthu cun ngthang hü lü däm law bawk bawki.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ephet mlüha suksaknak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Acun käna Pawluh cun, Maketawniha ja Akaijah üng kdung hü lü, Jerusalema cit khaia ngtängki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pawluh naw a mlunga mkhyah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pawluh cun Ngmüimkhya naw a mkhyahsak.</char></note> “Acua ka ceh käna Romah pi ka hmu khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Khüipüiki xawi nghngih, Timoti ja Eratuh cun Maketawniha hnea jah cehsak lü, amät cun Asah hnea ve hüki.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Acuna kcün üng Epheta Bawipaa Mawnglama phäh aktäa khuikhanak veki.<verse eid="ACT 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Dematarih ngming naki, nguiksep naw Artimih mhnam nghnumicaa alup sep se, a khyange naw khawhthem khawhah yah nakie.<verse eid="ACT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Ani naw, ami bi tängkia nguiksepe jah ngcunpüi lü, “Ka püie aw, hina khawhthem cun hin mi bilawhnak üng lawki tia mi ksingki,<verse eid="ACT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Tuha Pawluh naw, ‘Khyanga kut am pyang naküt cun mhnama am kya ve’ ti lü, hina Epheta däka am kya, Asah hne naküt üng pi khyang khawha jah ksük se, hmu u lü nami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>“Acunakyase, mi bi, ngui mi yahnak ami jah hmumsit law däk vaia am ni lü mi thang pi se khai ni, hlüngtaikia Artimih mhnam nghnumicaa Temple pi hmumsit law u se, Asah hne üng khyange naküt, khawmdeka khana khyange naw ami jum khawi hin, ia am mawng law khai ni tia pi kyühei phya ve” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Acuna ngthu ami ngjak üng ami mlung so law se, “Ephet mlüha ka Artimih hin hlüngtai kcangki ni” tia, ngpyangkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Mlüh avan üng acun ngthang hüki. Kajas ja Aristakhas, Maketawnih khyang xawi Pawluh naw a jah ngkhahpüi cun jah mankie naw, pawi binak ima ami jah cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pawluh cun khyangea maa cit khaia bü se, jumeikie naw ami mkhyawh.<verse eid="ACT 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Acunüng, acuna hne üngka ngvaie, Pawluha püie naw, a veia khyang tüih u lü, pawi binak ima käh cit khai ami nghuinak.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Ngbäm lawki he khawhah naw ami ngbäm lawa suilam pi am ksing u, acunakyase, avang ngthu mat pyen lü ngpyang u se, avang ngthu akce am ngpyangkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Acunüng, khyang avange naw Aleksanda cun üng mta veki ni ami ti, isetiakyaküng, Judahe naw ani cun maa ami cehsak ni ami ti. Acunüng, Aleksanda naw a kut khyange veia käh khikheh khaiea säng lü, amät sungkhamei khaia ngbüki.<verse eid="ACT 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Acunsepi, ani cun Judah khyanga kyaki ti ami ksing üng, naji nghngih hlawk atänga, “Epheta ka Artimih hin hlüngtaiki ni” tia aktäa ngpyangkie.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Acunüng, mlüh kcak’yu naw khyange a jah dimsak lü, “Ephet khyange aw, Ephet mlüh cun hlüngtaikia Artimih Temple ngängki ja khankhawa khyüh lung ngcim kya lawki ni a ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Acunakyase, u am ngtek khawh u ki. Nami dim vai, amdanga i käh nami pawh vai.<verse eid="ACT 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Hin üng nami jah lawpüi xawi hin, Temple phyehkiea am kya ni, nami mhnam pi am ksekha na ni.<verse eid="ACT 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Acunakyase, Dematarih ja a püi nguiksepe naw, nami ngcuh vai am vea kya üng kami ngvaie vekie, junga pi mi cit khaie ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Akce mtai vai nami tak üng pi, kcang mkhyah vai mlüha veki khyange am mi ngkhyum khaie ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Tungawi thawnhlawkia phäha mi kyühkyawk vai suksaknak vaia veki. Isetiakyaküng hina am kcangkia ngbämnak cun ami jah msuhei ta ihawkba pi am mi pyen thei khai ni.<verse eid="ACT 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Acun a pyen päng ja ngbäme a jah tüih be.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Maketawnih ja Akhacia citkie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Suksaknak a ngdüm law käna, Pawluh naw jumeikie atänga jah khü lü ngjuktha jah pe lü a jah ngtaipüi. Ani cun jah cehta lü Maketawniha citki.<verse eid="ACT 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>A ceh sawa acuna hne cu khyang khawhah ngjuktha jah peki. Acun käna Akhacia cit lü,<verse eid="ACT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>acua khya kthum veki. Ani cun Siriaa cit khai ngtängki lüpi Judahe naw ami pawh vaia ceng u se, Maketawniha da nglat khaia ngtünki.<verse eid="ACT 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Puruha cakpa Sapotah Beriha ka, Aristakhas ja Sekudah Thesalonikaha ka xawi, Kajas cun Derbea ka, Timoti, Taikikah ja Throphimah Asaha ka xawi, acune cun ani üng atänga veia cit hngakie.<verse eid="ACT 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Acunee cun ana cit ma u lü, Tarosa keimi jah na k'äihkie.<verse eid="ACT 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Keimi cun hngen am kcaw muk pawi käna, Philipih üngka naw mlawng am cit u lü, amhnüp mhma üng Taros kami phaki; acua mhnüp khyüh kami veki.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tarosa Pawluh citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Acunüng, mhnüp khyühnak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mhnüp khyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mhnüp kcük.</char></note> mümlama bu ei yüm vaia kami ngcunki. Acunüng Pawluh cun a ngawi üng cit khaia bükia kyase, ami veia ngthu pyenki naw, mthan nglung cäpa a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Kami ngcunnak khan ima meiim khawhah ami jah mdäi.<verse eid="ACT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Etukhuh ngming naki cawngpyang mat mkawt peia ngaw lü, a mik ku se ngam lü veki. Acunüng, Pawluha ngthu pyen thuk law se, ip tawng lü im athat kthumnak üngka naw mcea kya se akthia ami law be.<verse eid="ACT 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Acunüng, Pawluh kyumki naw, a khana ngbawk lü kawiki naw, “Käh ng’ä ua, xüng ham ve” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Pawluh kai be lü, muk bo lü eiki. Khaw athaih law lü nghngi a pyü law cäpa ngthu pyen lü, acun käna citki.<verse eid="ACT 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Acunüng, cawngpyang cun akxünga ima cehpüi be u se aktäa ami mlung dim’yeki.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taros üngka naw Miletuh da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Keimi cun mlawng am law u lü, Asiha kami cit khaia mlawng am kami na cit maki, acunüng Pawluh cun kami ngcum lawpüi vaia kami täng kyaw; a khaw am law khaia ngtängki.<verse eid="ACT 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Asiha jah na ngkhyum püi lü, ani kpan law lü Mituliniha kami citki.<verse eid="ACT 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Acunüng ka naw, mlawng am cit u lü, a ngawi üng Kioh kami phaki. A ngawi üng, Samoh pha u lü, a ngawi be tü üng Miletuh kami phaki.<verse eid="ACT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Pawluh cun Asaha khawvei a ve vai am täng lü, Ephet da cun mlawng am cit khaia bü kungkia kyaki, athawn theia kyak üng Jerusalema Pentikos mhnüp üng a pha vai ngsengeiki.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ephet sangcim ngvaiea veia Pawluha ngtainak ngthu pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Acunüng, Miletuh khaw üngka naw, Epheta khyang tüih lü, sangcim ngvaie a jah hmuh vaia a ja khüsak.<verse eid="ACT 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Acunüng, a veia ami pha law üng, Pawluh naw, “Asah hne ka pha law üng tün lü, atuh cäpa ihawkba ka kcün ka sumeiki tia nami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Mdihmsuinak ja ka kphyutui baw lü Bawipaa mpya akba khut ka biki. Isetiakyaküng Judahe naw na hnim khai ami büa phäh kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Nangmi am ka ning jah kuei vaia i pi am ka thupki tia nami ksingki ni, khyangea ksunga ja im naküt üng ka ning jah mthei khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Judahe ja khyangmjükceea veia pi Pamhnama veia nghlat law be u lü, mi Bawipa Jesuh ami jumei lawnak vaia ngthu ka pyen ni.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Acunüng, atuha Ngmüimkhya Ngcim kcang na lü Jerusalem da ka cit khai, acua kei ia na pawh khaie am ksingei veng.<verse eid="ACT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Ka cehnak hü mlüh naküta thawng jah mkhuimkhanak naw na k'äihki tia Ngmüimkhya ngcim naw na mthehki ni.<verse eid="ACT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:7">2Tim 4:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunsepi, ka kcün sak hin ia am kya, isetiakyaküng thangkdaw tinaki Pamhnama bäkhäknak sang lü, Bawipa Jesuh naw a na peta khut ja mission cun ka mcän vai ni ka hlüei ta.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>Acunüng, nangmi, Pamhnama pea mawng sang lü nami veia ka cit hüki. Tuh ta nangmi naw am nami na hmu be ti khai tia ka ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Acunakyase, nami khyüha kyak üng keia mtaa am kya ve tia tungawi angtea ning jah mtheh veng.<verse eid="ACT 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Pamhnama a ngjak'hlü naküt avan, nami veia am pyen hlü lü ka mji i am ve.<verse eid="ACT 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Acunakyase, nami mät ja namimät mcei ua, Pamhnam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnam; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa.</char></note> naw a cakpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A Cakpaa thi üngkhyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">a Cakpa thihnak üngkhyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amäta thi üngkhyüh.</char></note> thisen am a khyäiha sangcim nami mcah khaia Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw aning jah mceisaka tome cän pi jah mcei ua.<verse eid="ACT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ka ceh käna mhnge kyung he nami ksunga law u lü, ami naw tomee käh jah mpyenei khaie tia ka ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Namimät üngka khyang avange law u lü jumeikie jah mhlei lü ami jah läk vaia thawn law khaie.<verse eid="ACT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Acunakyase, mcei ua; kum kthum ka kphyutui baw lü, amhnüp amthan ka ning jah mthei cän süm ua.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Tuhkbäih Pamhnama bäkhäknaka ngthu üng ka ning jah taki, acun naw ning jah sawngsa lü, ani naw Pamhnama dawkyanak a khyangea phäh a tak cun ning jah pe khai.<verse eid="ACT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Ua xüi, ngui, suisak pi am hlüei khawi veng.<verse eid="ACT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Kamät ja ka püiea hlükaw cun kamät bilo lü kami eiawki ti cun namimät naw nami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 20:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Acukba nangmi pi khüi u lü, Bawipa Jesuha ngthu nami sümnak am, ktha ngcekie nami jah kpüi vaia, anaküt ka binak am ka ning jah mdanki; amät Jesuh naw, ‘Yahnaka kthaka petmsawtnak üng jekyainak bawk ni” ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Acunüng, acukba ngthu a pyen law päng üng, ami mkhuk jah sümpüi lü ktaiyükie.<verse eid="ACT 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Ami van kyap u lü, Pawluh cun kawi u lü aktäa mhnamkie.<verse eid="ACT 20:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Ani am ami hmuh be ti vaia cun a pyena kyase ami mlung thüikiea kyaki. Acunüng, mlawnga venak cäpa cit u lü ami tha.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Jerusalema citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Amimi am kami ngtai käna, mlawng am cit u lü Kotah kami pha lawki. Acunüng, angawi üng Rodih pha u lü, acun üngka naw cit u lü, Patarah kami phaki.<verse eid="ACT 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Phonisia cit khaia mlawng mat hmu u ngüse, acun ngcum u lü kami citki.<verse eid="ACT 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Kuparuh hmunaka cit u lü, cumlama cit u lü Siria kami phaki. Acunüng Turah tui pei kami phaki. Acua mlawng üngka phüihe jah lawh vaia kyase.<verse eid="ACT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Acunüng, jumeikie jah hmu u lü, acua mhnüp khyüh kami veki; acunüng, anini naw Pawluh cun Ngmüimkhya am mtheh u lü, Jerusalema käh a ceh vaia ami mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Acunsepi, acuna mhnüp päih law se, jah tak hüt lü kami kdungki u lü, cit u ngü se, ami van naw, ami khyucae mah maha mlüh khaw kpung üngkhyüh tui pei cäpa am jah tha law; acua mkhuk msüm u lü kami ktaiyüki.<verse eid="ACT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>“Mya lü bä” ti u lü mat jah mat mtheh lü mlawng üng kami ngcum üng amimi cun ami ima nghlat bekie.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Acunüng, Turah üngka naw mlawng am kami ceh law päng üng, Potalemaia kami phaki, acua jumeikie jah hnukset u lü, ami veia mhnüp mät kami veki.<verse eid="ACT 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 6:5">Ngs 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char>
    </note>A ngawi be tü üng, Ketarih kami phaki; acua thangkdaw sangki Philipa ima kami lutki, ani cun Jerusalema jah kpüi khaia xü, khyühe üngka mata kyase a veia kami veki.<verse eid="ACT 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Ani cun nghnumica phyü jah ca naki. Amimi naw Pamhnama ngthu sang hükie.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:28">Ngs 11:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acua mhnüp khawvei kami vekie, acuna üng Judah hnea ka Akabas ngming naki sahma mat lawki.<verse eid="ACT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Kami veia law lü, Pawluha ksawmyüi lo lü amäta kut khawe jah khit lü, “Jerusalema Judahe naw hikba hina ksawmyüi ka naki khit u lü, khyangmjükceea kut üng ap khaie, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw a pyen ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Acuna ngthu kami ngjak ja, Pawluh cun Jerusalema käh cit khaia keimi jah akcee naw kami nghuinak.<verse eid="ACT 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Pawluh naw, “I vai kyap u lü, ka mlung nami na puksetsaki ni? Bawipa Jesuha ngminga phäha ta Jerusalema ami na khih däka am kya lü thih vaia pi ka lingki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Mtheh lü am ng’yah se, “Bawipa hlüeia kya kawm” kami ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Acua kcün kami sumei käna kami phüie jah pitpyang u lü, Jerusalema kami citki.<verse eid="ACT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Ketariha üngka axüisawe avang kami hlawnga law hngakie naw,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kami kainak vaia ima a jah cehpüi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">kami kainak vaia ima ka khyang cun ami lawpüi.</char></note> Manatung ngming naki jumei kcük üngka, Kuparuha ka mat, kami cehnaka ami ngkhahpüi hnga.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jakuka veia Pawluh citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Jerusalem mlüh kami pha üng jumeikie naw hlimtui khaia ami ja na khinnak.<verse eid="ACT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>A ngawi üng, Pawluh naw Jakuka ima jah cehpüi se, acua sangcim ngvaie veki.<verse eid="ACT 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Pawluh naw amimi jah hnukset law päng lü, a khüibinak summangei lü Pamhnam naw khyangmjükceea veia bi a bisak naküt avan a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Amimi naw acuna ngthu ami ngjak üng Pamhnam mhlünmtai u lü, Pawluha veia, “Pawluh aw, Judah khyange thawng khawhah jumei lawki ja ami van naw Thum pi kthanakie;<verse eid="ACT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>acunsepi, khyangmjükceea veia vekiea Judahea veia, ami cae ami vun käh ami jah mawih vai ja Mosia Thum ami hawih vaia na ja mtheiki tia pyenkie.<verse eid="ACT 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Ihawkba kya hlüki ni? Na pha law pi ngjakie ni.<verse eid="ACT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:23,24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Num 6:13-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunakyase, na veia kami pawh vai cun hin ni. Khyütam taeiki khyang kphyü kami vekie.<verse eid="ACT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Acune jah ngkhahpüi lü, ngcimcaihnak pawia va ngpüi hnga lü, lu kteinaka phu jah pet pe kaw pi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ami lu kteihkie: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bük 18.18</char></note> Acunüng, khyange naw, ami ngjak am kcangki tia, namät kung naw Mosi thum na läki tia ksing khaie.<verse eid="ACT 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:29">Ngs 15:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Khyangmjükce jumeikie am, juktuh üng peta eiawk, khisa thi, khisa ami kbüh ja hüipawmnake üng ami ngcimcaih vaia kyaki tia, ca kami yuk päng ni” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Acuna ngawi üng Pawluh naw, acuna kpamie jah ngkhahpüiki naw, ami veia ngcimcaih hnga lü, Templea k'uma lutki naw, ami ngkhäa phäha petnak akce pawh lü ngcimcaihnaka mhnüpa kümnak vaia mhnüp cun ivei hjo khai ti cun a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Temple k'uma Pawluh ami man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Mhnüp khyüh a küm law hlü üng, Asah üngka Judahe naw Pawluh templea k'uma hmu u lü, khyange naküt jah ksükie naw ami man.<verse eid="ACT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Ngpyang u lü, “Isarel khyange aw, jah kpüi law ua, hin naw khaw naküt üng khyang naküta veia, Judah khyangea thume, hina Temple jah kse na ve; acun däk am ni, templea k'uma pi Krik khyange jah luhpüi lü, hina Temple ngcimcaiki pi mtüihkhehsaki ni” ami ti. (<verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ngs 20:4</ref></char></note>Am acun ham üng Epheta ka Throphimah naki Pawluh naw mlüh k'uma a ceh hü püi hmu u se, templea k'uma cehpüikia pi ami ngaih.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Mlüh üngka ami van üng ngthang hü lü, ngbäm lawki he naw, Pawluh man u lü, temple kpunga kaih lawki he naw, asäng üng ksawhe ami jah khaih law.<verse eid="ACT 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Pawluh hnim vaia ami bü ja, Jerusalema khyange naküt aktäa suksak lawki he tia ngthu cun Romah yekap ngvai säiha veia phaki.<verse eid="ACT 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Acunüng, ani naw yekape ja yekap ngvaie jah cehpüi lü, ami veia dawng ktäi se; yekap ngvai säih ja yekape jah hmu u lü, Pawluh ami kpai cun ami hjaüh.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Yekap ngvai säih naw Pawluh law sih lü, manki naw, mthiyüi nghngih am jah khisak lü, ua kyaki, i pawh khawiki tia a kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Khyange akce pyen u lü ngpyang u se, i ami pyen am ksing thei lü, Pawluh cun yekapea venaka ami cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Acunüng, khyange naw aktäa kutban na hlü u se thukcakia ceh u lü, yekape naw kawt u lü Pawluh cun ami cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 21:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Khyang naküt naw, “hnim ua” tia Pawluha hnua ngpyangkie.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh amät asungkhamnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Pawluh naw yekapea venaka ami luh law hlüpüi üng yekap ngvai säiha veia, “Na veia ngthu pyen lü ng’yah khai aw?” a ti. Acunüng, ani naw, “Krik ngthu pyen theiki aw? ti lü akthäh.<verse eid="ACT 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Nang ajana, yea ngthawn lü, khyang thawng kphyü ye vaia kpyawnga ja dawngpüikia Egypt khyanga am na kyaki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pawluh naw, “Kei cun Kilikih hne, Tasuh mlüha ngtüikia Judah khyanga ka kyaki, ka venaka mlüh pi sawxata am kya, mlüh ktung ni, na bä ni hina khyangea veia ngthu na pyensaka” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai säih naw täng se, Pawluh naw khyak üng ngdüi lü, khyangea ngdümnak vaia a kut kha lü ami ngdüm law ja, Hebru ngthu am:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>“Ka püi Isarele aw, ka ngsungkhameinak vai na ngai ua” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Hebru ngthu am, ami veia ngthu pyenki ti ami ksing ja, käh khihkheh law u se, acunüng, Pawluh naw,<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Ngs 5:34-39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kei cun Kilikih hne, Tasuh mlüha ngtüikia Judah khyanga ka kyaki, acunsepi, hina Jerusalema Kamaleilaha vei ngthei lü ka ngbang lawki, jah mjükphyüinakiea thume pi ka ngthei khawiki, tungawi üng nangmia mäiha Pamhnama phäha ka ktha na khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:4,5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ngs 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, nghnumi kpami ja man lü thawngim üng jah khyum lü, thihnak vaia acuna Bawipaa Mawnglam läkie cun ka jah mkhuimkha khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja kawngcie naküt naw pi acuna ngthu cun cangki tia na ksing püikie, Damateta veki ka püi Judahe vei ami yuk ca pi ka yahki; acuna kyase acua cit lü, jah man lü Jerusalema jah cehpüi lü jah mkhuimkha khaia ka citki.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh naw a ngthunghlainaka mawng a pyen </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ngs 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>Cit lü, Damateta pei ka pha law üng, mhnüp nglunga angxita khana ka akvai aktäa vaiki ka peia vai lawki.<verse eid="ACT 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Mdek üng ka kyuk üng, ka veia, “Sawluh, Sawluh, ise na na mkhuimkhaki ni?” tia kthai ka ngjak.<verse eid="ACT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Acunüng, kei naw, ‘Bawipa aw, nang u ni?’ ti lü ka msang be. Acunüng, ani naw, ‘Kei Nazaret Jesuh, na mkhuimkhaa ka kyaki’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Acunüng, ka püie naw akvai cun ami hmu te, na ngthuheipüikia kthai cun am ngjak u.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Kei naw, ‘Bawipa aw i ka pawh khai?’ ka ti. Acunüng, Bawipa naw, ‘Tho law lü, Damateta cita, na pawh vai naküt cun ning mtheh khaie ni’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Acuna akvaia phäha ka mik mü se, ka püie naw ami kut am na kaih u lü, Damateta ka citki.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>Khyang mat Anani ngming naki, thum kcang na lü Judahe naw ami leisawng acua veki.<verse eid="ACT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Ka veia law lü, ka peia ngdüi lawki naw, ‘Ka na Sawluh aw, mdei law be a ti. Acunüng, hmu law be ngüse ka teng kyet.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Ani naw, ‘Mi pupaea Pamhnam naw, a hlüei na ksing khaia, ngsungpyunki Mpya na hmu khaia, a ngthu na ngjak khaia, ning xü pängki ni;<verse eid="ACT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Na hmu ja na ngjaka ngthu cun khyang naküta veia ania phäh saksi khai.<verse eid="ACT 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Ise na ve sawxatki ni? Tho law lü, Baptican khana. A veia na ktaiyü üng na mkhyekatnake ja kpyawta kya khai’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Khyangmjükceea veia ngthu pyen khaia citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>Jerusalema ka ceh be käna, temple k'uma ka ktaiyü k'um üng, mdangnak ka hmuhki,<verse eid="ACT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>mdangnak üng Bawipa naw, ‘Angxita Jerusalem üngka naw cita; ka ngthu na sang vai ahin üng am ning ngja hlü ve u’ a ti cun ka khamei yahki.<verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Kei naw, ‘Bawipa aw, sinakok naküta jumeiki naküt thawngim üng ja khyum lü, ka jah kpai khawi ksingkie;<verse eid="ACT 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:58">Ngs 7:58</ref>
      </char>
    </note>na saksi Stephena thisen ami hnim üng, kei pi a peia ngdüi hnga lü, a thih vai yüna lü, hnimki hea ami suisak ka na kpawmki’ ka ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Ani naw, ‘Cita, hin üngka naw athuknak, khyangmjükceea veia ning tüih veng’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Acuna ngthu a pyen veia khyange naw ngai u lü; acunüng, angsanga ngpyang u lü, “Ceh ta ua! Hnim ua, xüng khaia am daw ve” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Ngpyang u lü, ami suisake jah sut u lü, jah kha u lü, mput khan da phuh u se;<verse eid="ACT 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>acunüng, Romah yekap ngvai säih naw, Pawluh ise acukba ami pawh tia ksing hlü lü, “Yekapea venaka ceh u lü, kpai u lü ise Judahe acukba ngpyangkie ti cun kcet ua” ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Acunüng, khit u lü kpai u se, Pawluh naw, a peia ngdüikia yekap ngvai üng, “Romah khyang naki, am mkhyenak angsinga am ksing xa u lü nami kpai hin nglawiki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai naw, acun a ngjak ja, yekap ngvai säiha veia cit lü, “Na bi law cän ngaia, hin hin Romah khyanga kya ve” ti lü, a mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai säih naw law lü, a veia, “Romah, khyanga na kyaki aw? Na mtheha” a ti. Acunüng, ani naw, “Ä, kei Romah khyang ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai säih naw, “Romah khyanga ka kyanak vaia ngui khawha ka peki ni” ti lü, msang se, acunüng, Pawluh naw, “Kei cun Romah khyanga ka ngtüi lawki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Acun ja kcet khaia bükie naw Pawluh cun angxita cehta u se; yekap ngvai säih naw pi, Romah khyang ni tia ksing lü, Romah khyang a khiha phäha aktäa kyühei lawki.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kawngci hmaia Pawluh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>A ngawi üng, Judahe naw ise Pawluh ami hneng ti ksing hlü lü, yekap ngvai säih naw Pawluh cun xaki naw, ktaiyü ngvaie ja ngthumkhyahkie naküt jah ngbämsak lü, ani cun lawpüiki naw, ami hmaia a ngdüih lawsak.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pawluh naw kawngci jah bük lü, “Ka püi Isarele, Tungawi cäpa Pamhnama hmaia ngcimcaihkia mlungmthin am ka xüngseiki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Ktaiyü ngvai Anani naw a peia ngdüikie üng Pawluha mpyawng ami kbei vaia a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mt 23:27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref></char>
    </note>Acunüng, Pawluh naw, “Nang abawk am hluka lung, Mhnam naw ni kbei khai; ngthumkhyah khaia ngawh lü, am kcang khaia thum pawh lü ami na kbei vaia na pyenki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>A peia kae naw, “Pamhnama ktaiyü ngvai na ksekhanaki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Ex 22:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pawluh naw, “Ka püi Isarele aw, ktaiyü ngvaia akya am ksing veng; ‘Na khyang jah upki käh na ksekhanak vai’ tia Cangcim naw pyenki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Ngs 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phi 3:5</ref></char>
    </note>Pawluh naw, avang Sadukee, avang Pharisee tia ksing lü, “Ka püi Isarele aw, kei Pharisea ka kyaki, Pharisea cakpaa pi ka kyaki; khyangkthi tho be khai tia ka äpeia phäh, ahikba nami na kcetki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Cunüng, acuna ngthu a pyen law päng ja, Pharisee ja Sadukee ngcuh law u lü, ngtai lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mt 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mk 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Lk 20:27</ref></char>
    </note>Ami ngtainaka suilam cun, Sadukee naw, “Khyangkthia thawnak be am veki, khankhawngsä he, Ngmüimkhyae am veki” ti khawi u se; Pharisee naw, acuna lam kthum cun veki tia ami juma phäha kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Pharise da ka thum ksinge ngdüi law u lü, “Hina a katnak i am ksing ve üng; Ngmüimkhya naw pi kyase, khankhawngsä naw pi kyase, a ngthuheipüi üng pi, ia am kya?” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Ngcuh law dämdäm u se, yekap ngvai säih naw, Pawluh man u lü, amte mtea ami pawh law vai kyühki naw, yekape veia cit u lü ami vei üngka naw yekapea venaka ami cehpüi vaia a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh ami hnimnak hlü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Acunüng, mthana Bawipa cun Pawluha peia ngdüi lü, “Käh cäi kawpi, ka ngthu Jerusalema na saksia mäiha Romaha pi na saksi khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh ami hnim vaia ami bü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Khawthai law lü Judah khyange, Pawluh am ami hnima küt üng i käh eiaw khaiea, ng'yüngce u lü vekie.<verse eid="ACT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Acukba ng'yüngce u lü ngkhämkie cun khyang kphyükipa kthaka nungkie.<verse eid="ACT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Acunee cun ktaiyü ngvaie ja ngvaiea veia cit u lü, “Pawluh am kami hnima küt üng i käh kami mdep khaia kami ng'yüngceki ni.<verse eid="ACT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Acunakyase, khaw ngawia, yekap ngvai säih naw Pawluh cun nangmia veia lawpüi lü, ngkhai ngai khaia nami kcet vaia mäiha, ngvaie am atänga yekap ngvai säiha veia kthäh ua, acun üng Pawluh hnim vai ami täng. Acunüng, Pawluh nami veia am a pha law ham üng keimi cun kami hnim khaia, ngtün päng ve üng” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Acunsepi, Pawluha a naa ca naw, lama ami na maha mawng cun ngja lü, yekapea venakaa va lutki naw, Pawluh am a va mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Pawluh naw, yekap ngvai mat khü lü, “Hina cawngpyang hin yekap ngvaisäiha veia cehpüia; i mä a pyen vai ve khai ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Yekap ngvaia veia cehpüi lü, “Thawngim üng kyumkia Pawluh naw na khü lü, hina cawngpyang na veia ka lawpüi khaia, ana tüih law, na veia i mä a pyen vai ve ve” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvai säih naw a kut üng man lü, akcea cehpüiki naw, “I na na mtheh hlüki?” ti lü a kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Ani naw “Judah ngvaie naw khaw ngawia Pawluh kawngcia na lawpüi vai ngjak'hlü ve u. Pawluha mawng cun ami naw aksing ngtea ksing hlükie hana ngsaih ve u, a ti.”<verse eid="ACT 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Acunsepi, ami pyen käh jah na kcang na kawpi; khyang kphyükipa kthaka nungkie naw ani k'äih u lü ngthupkie ni, acune cun ani, am ami hnima küt üng i käh eiaw khaiea ng'yüngcekie ni; atuh na ja msangnak be vaia ngthu k'äihkie, ngtün u lü vekie ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Acunüng, yekap ngvaisäih naw cawngpyang cun tüih be lü, “Hina ngthu na na mtheh hin u pi käh ksingsak kawpi” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pe uk Felika veia Pawluh ami tüih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Yekap ngvai säih naw jung ngvai nghngih jah khü lü, “Tuh mü naji kaw üng, Ketarih khaw cäpa cit khaia yekap phyanghngih, ngsela ngcumki khyang khyühkip, kcei kawtki khyang phyanghngih ngsungcei u se ti lü” a jah mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Pe uk Felika veia phyawn lü pha khaia, Pawluha ngcumnak vaia ngsela ami pet vaia pi a jah mtheh sih.<verse eid="ACT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Ngvai naw hikba ca yu lü;<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>“Kalawdih Lusik aw ami leisawnga pe uk Felik naw ning hnukset ve.<verse eid="ACT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Hina khyang Judahe naw man u lü ami hnim law hlü ja, ami veia yekape jah ngkhahpüi lü ka citki, Romah khyang ni tiaa ksing lü ka yung law.<verse eid="ACT 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Acunüng, ami mkatnaka suilam ksing hlü lü, ami kawngciea veia ka cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Ami thum ia phäha ami mkat tia ka ksing, acunsepi ami mkatnak üng thihnak vai ja man u lü thawng üng khyum vaia anglawinak i am hmu veng.<verse eid="ACT 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Judahe naw ami hnim vaia kham hükie ni tia khyang naw a na mtheh ja, na veia ka tüih law ni, mkatkie naw pi ami mkatnaka mawng na hmaia ami pyen vaia ngthu ka jah pet ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Ngthu a jah peta mäiha yekape naw mthan nglunga Pawluh cun man u lü, Antipatariha ami cehpüi.<verse eid="ACT 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>A ngawi üng, ngsela ngcumkie Pawluh am jah cehsak u lü, amimät cun yekapea venaka nghlat law bekie.<verse eid="ACT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Ketarih ami pha law üng, ca cun pe uk Felik am pe u lü, Pawluh cun pi ami msum.<verse eid="ACT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Pe uk naw a kheh law päng üng, Pawluha venaka khaw a kthäh. Acunüng, Kilikih khawa ka ni tia a ksing law ja,<verse eid="ACT 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>“Ning mkatkie ami pha law käna, na mawng ka ning ngaih pet khai” a ti. Acunüng, Pawluh cun pe uka junga ami ngäng vaia ngthu a jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Judahe naw Pawluh ami mkat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Amhnüp mhma käna, ktaiyü ngvai säih Anani, ngvaie avang ja seihne Tetulah ngsut lawki he naw, Pawluha mawng cun pe uka veia ami pyen law.<verse eid="ACT 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Acunüng, Pawluh cun khü u lü Tetulah naw mkat law lü, “Bawi kdaw säih aw, nanga phäha dim’yenak am kami vea phäh, kami pea phäh na jah thunghlai hin nanga jah cehcawn phäh ni.<verse eid="ACT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Angläta, a hawa pi jenak am kami veki cun nanga bänak ni.<verse eid="ACT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Acunsepi, na kcün khawvei am la hlü veng lüpi, na mlunga a nemnak am ka pyen cun na ngaih pet vaia ning nghui na veng.<verse eid="ACT 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Hina khyang hin, Nazaret ami ti khyange üng ngvai bi lü, khawmdeka khana Judahe naküt jah suksaki kami ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Pamhnama temple pi mtüihkhehsaki; acunakyase, kami man ni.<verse eid="ACT 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Na thuma mäiha, a mawng mtai pet vaia kami tängki ni, acunsepi yekap ngvaisäih Lusika naw law lü, kami kut üngka asihlinga jah hut hlawk lü, amät kami mkatkie na veia law vaia ngthu a jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Namät naw hina khyang kthäh lü, kami mkatnak naküt cun na ksing khai ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Acunüng, Judahe naw pi law u lü ahin hin kcangki ni” tia ami pyen sih.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Felika hmaia a ngsungkhameinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Pe uk naw Pawluh cun ngthu pyen khaia a kut säng se ta, Pawluh naw, “Nang kum khawvei hina khyangmjü lei jah mkhyah pe lü na veki tia ka ksinga phäha, aktäa jenak am kamäta ngsungkhameinak na hmaia ngthu ka pyen law khai.<verse eid="ACT 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Jerusalema Pamhnam hjawkhah khaia ka cehnak atuh mhnüp xaleinghngih va law hamki tia namät naw na ksing khai.<verse eid="ACT 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Temple k'uma pi, sinakoka pi, mlüha pi, upi ka ngcuhpüi, khyang ka ksük pi am na hmu u.<verse eid="ACT 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Tukbäih pi, ami na mkatnak vai tuilam am mdan thei ve u.<verse eid="ACT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Acunsepi, hin hin na veia ka phyeh khai, Kami pupaea Mhnam kei naw ka hjawkhah Mawnglam cun am kcang ami ti ni. Sahmaea caupe jah Mosia thum üng ng’yuk nakütki pi ka jum hngaki.<verse eid="ACT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Ka äpnak pi veki ta Pamhnam naw khyang naküt akdaw ja akse pi thihnak üngkhyüh jah mtho law be khai ni.<verse eid="ACT 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Acuna phäha, Pamhnam veia ja nghngicima veia pi, ka mlungmthina käh mkhyemsawh vaia ka ktha naki.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17,18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Ngs 21:17-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, kum khawvei anghjawk käna ka khyangea ngui jah pet vai ja ngkengtainak pawh khaia ka lawki.<verse eid="ACT 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Ngcimngcaihnak pawi päng lü ahine ka jah pawh k'um üng amimi naw Templea na hmuhkie. Ka hlawnga khyange ja suksaknak pi am ve u.<verse eid="ACT 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Acua, Asah üngka Judahe pi vekie, acune naw law u lü ka khana ami pyen vai a vea kyak üng, hin üng na hmaia ve u lü na mkat khaie sü.<verse eid="ACT 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Am acunüng, hina khyange naw, kawngcia hmaia ka ngdüih üng, ka katnak ami hmuh khawia kyak üng atuh pyen u se,<verse eid="ACT 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:6">Ngs 23:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kawngcia hmaia ka pyen mata, ‘Khyangkthi tho be khai tia ka jumeia phäha na mkatei u lü tuhngawi nami hmaia ami na lawpüi ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Acunüng, Felik naw, Mawnglam cun ana ksing lawa kyase, “Yekap ngvai säih Lusika a pha law üng na mawng ka ning mkhyah pet khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Pawluh cun a jah ngängsak vai ja, a püipawe naw pi law u lü ami mbeimbawk law vaia yekap ngvai am ngthu a pet.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Felik ja a khyu Dusilaha hmaia Pawluh ngdüiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Mhnüp khawveica anghjawk käna, Felik cun a khyu Dusilah, Judah nghnumi ngkhahpüi lü law beki naw, Pawluh ja khüsak lü, Khritaw Jesuh jumnaka ngthu cun ngaiki.<verse eid="ACT 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Pawluh naw, dawkyanaka ngthu, mät ja mät nängeinaka ngthu, ngthumkhyahnak ve law khaia ngthue a jah mtheh üng, Felik naw aktäa kyüh law lü, “Cit be maa, akcün a awng üng, ning khü law be kawm” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Pawluh naw ngui a pet vai a ngaihk’uheia kyase, khü lü a kthäha kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Acunsepi, kum nghngih päih käna, Pocih Festuh naw Felik mthawng se; acunüng, Felik naw Judahea ksunga a ngminga daw vai ngai lü Pawluh cun thawngim üng a khyum hüt.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Festuh Emperoa veia Pawluh ngdüiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Festuh naw khaw a uk law, amhnüp thum käna Ketarih mlüh üngka naw Jerusalema citki.<verse eid="ACT 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Judah üng axüngvaie naw Pawluha mawng cun akse lama ami na mtheh.<verse eid="ACT 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Jerusalem mlüh üngka naw a jah laksak vaia nghui na u lü, lama a na kham u lü ami hnim vaia ami bü.<verse eid="ACT 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Acunsepi, Festuh naw, “Pawluh cun Ketariha thawngima, kei pi acua ka cit be khai.<verse eid="ACT 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Acunakyase, nami mkhawnge Ketarih khawa Pawluh mkatei khaiea ka hlawnga cit hnga u se, kakia akya üng” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Ami veia, mhnüp khyet, mhnüp xa hlawk a ve khap üng, Ketariha ju cit beki; acunüng, a ngawia ngthumkhyahnak üng ngaw lü, Pawluh ami lawpüi vaia ngthu a ja pet.<verse eid="ACT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Acunüng, ami lawpüi ja, Jerusalem üngka naw ju lawki hea Judahe cun a peia ngdüi u lü, a khana am cangkia mkatnak khawha ami pyen. A mkhyenak kcang cun am ami msuh thei.<verse eid="ACT 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Pawluh naw a cangnaka ngthu pyen lü, “Judahea thuma khana pi kyase, Pamhnama temple khana pi kyase, Romah Emperoa khana pi kyase, katnak ka pawh i am ve naw” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Acunsepi Festuh naw, Judahea khana a ngminga kdaw vai ngja hlü lü, Pawluh üng “Jerusalema hang cit lü, acuia ka hmaia hina mawng mtai vai na ngaiki aw?” ti lü, a kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Pawluh naw, “Romah Emperoa ngthumkhyahnaka hmaia ka ngdüi hlüki ni; Judahea khana katnak i am pawh ni se, acun cun nang naw haw angsinga ksing ye lü.<verse eid="ACT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Thum lümkan lü, thihnak vaia katnak ka pawh üng ta ka thih vai pi am ma nawng; acunsepi, hinea ami na khyaknak aphung i am a ve üng, u süm naw ami veia käh na pe thei khai. Romah Emperoa veia ka ngdüi khai” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Festuh naw a ngthumkhyahpüie a ja ksük käna, “Romah Emperoa veia ngsut khaia bü veki, Emperoa veia na ngsut law mkyäi khai ni” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akipah ja Berania hmaia Pawluh ngdüiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Angsawkca käna, sangpuxang Akipah ja Berani cun Ketarih Mlüha ngsut law ni lü, Festuh ani hnukset law.<verse eid="ACT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Acunüng, mhnüp khawvei acuia veki xawia kyase, Festuh naw Pawluha mawng cun sangpuxanga veia pyen lü, “Felik naw thawngim üng kyumki u aw yawk hüt se;<verse eid="ACT 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Jerusalema ka ve hui üng, ktaiyü ngvaie ja Judah ngvaie naw a mawng na mtheh u lü, mkat vaia ami na nghuinak.<verse eid="ACT 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Acunüng, kei naw ami veia, ‘Ami khyaka khyang ja khyakie ngkhyum u se, ami khyaknaka mawng üng cangnak am ami hmu hama küt üng, amät asungkhamei vai akcün am a yaha küt üng khyang u pi mkhuimkha vaia thum hin Romaha mi thuma am kyaki ni’ ti lü, ka ja msang.<verse eid="ACT 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Acune hina khaw ami pha law ja, käh msawk lü, a ngawia ngthumkhyahnak üng ngaw ktäi lü, ani cun ka ja khüsak.<verse eid="ACT 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Khyakie ami ngdüi law ja, ka ngaia mäi kunga, a khana a am dawkia mkhyenak i am pyen thei u.<verse eid="ACT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Ami jumnaka thume ja Jesuh khyang mat thi pängki cen Pawluh naw, ‘Xüng beki ni’ tia pyen se, acuna phäha, a khana katnak veki tia ami khyak lawa kya hüki.<verse eid="ACT 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Acunüng, kei naw acuna mäih cun ihawkba bi vai am ka ksingki naw, Jerusalema cit se, acuia a mawng mtai pet vai a ngai ja am a ngai ka kthäh sum.<verse eid="ACT 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh cun yekap am cit u lü hlüng säihkia sangpuxanga mtai pet vaia a nghuinak, acuna Romah Emperoa veia am ka tüih hama küt üng yekape am ka jah mtätsak” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Akipah naw Festuha veia, “Kei haw acuna ngthu pyen ka ngai vai ka na ngai khawiki ni” a ti. Acunüng, Festuh naw, “Khawngawia pyen se ngai kaw pi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Acukba, a ngawia, Akipah ja Berani cun hlüngtainak am law ni lü, yekap ngvaie ja mlüh üng khyang kyäp kyäpe am, ngthu pyennaka ima lut ni se; acunüng, Festuh naw Pawluh a ja lawsak.<verse eid="ACT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Festuh naw, “Sangpuxang Akipah ja hin üng vekiea khyange aw, hina nami hmu hin, a mawngmaa phäha, Judahe naküt naw mkatei u lü, käh xüng ti khai tia, Jerusalem mlüha ja hin üngkae naw ka veia ami kthäh.<verse eid="ACT 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Acunsepi, thihnak sen vaia i katnak am pawhki ti ka ksingki; acunüng, amät naw ngvaisäih sangpuxanga veia a ngsut vai ngaikia kyase, tüih vaia ka bü ni;<verse eid="ACT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>acunsepi, ania mawng Emperoa veia ka yuk vai am ksing veng. Acunakyase, nami hmaia ka lawpüi ni, sangpuxang Akipah nanga maa ka lawpüi ktunga kyaki ni, kthäh lü i yaw hleng yuk vai ka hmunak vaia.<verse eid="ACT 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Khyang kyum, sangpuxang ngvaisäiha veia tüih u lü, a mawng ami khyaknak, käh ksingsak lek cun, am mawngkia ngai veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Akipaha hmaia Pawluh a ngsungkhameinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Akipah naw Pawluh üng, “Na mäta phäh ngthu pyen lawa” a ti. Pawluh naw, a kut säng lü, a ngsungkhameinak pyen lawki;<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Sangpuxang Akipah aw, Judahe naw ami na khyaknak naküt üng, ka ngsungeinak ngthu tuhngawi na hmaia ka pyen khaia akyaka phäha, dawki ngai veng;<verse eid="ACT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Judahea thum ja ngcuhnak naküt aktäa ksingki. Na mlung msaü lü na na ngaih vaia ni nghui na veng.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Ka dik ham üng ihawkba ka ve khawiki ti cun Judah khyange avan naw na ksingkie. Akcüka kamäta pe ja Jerusalema ihawkba ka kcün ka sumei pi ksingkie.<verse eid="ACT 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:6">Ngs 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phi 3:5</ref></char>
    </note> Judah jumnak thum üng aktäa ling lü, Pharisea ka kya khawi cän ajana na ksingkie, ami pyen vai ta saksi na u se.<verse eid="ACT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Kami pupaea vei Pamhnam naw a jah peta khyütam äpeinaka phäha kei hia ka ngdüi law khaia na pawh ve u,<verse eid="ACT 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>amhnüp amthan Pamhnam hjawkhah u lü kami khyange pasang xaleihngihe naw ami yahei vaia äpeikie. Ahina äpeinaka phäh Judahe naw na mkatei ve u ahlüng säih sangpuxang aw.<verse eid="ACT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Hin üng veki khyange naw ise Pamhnam naw khyangkthi mtho beki ti hin, am a nami jum thei ni?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ngs 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> “Kei naw pi Nazaret Jesuha ngming cawkei lü, ka pawh khawh naküt cun ka bikia ka na ngai law khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Ahin hin Jerusalema ka bilo khawiki. Ktaiyü ngvaiea veia bilawnak thei ana yah lü, Mhnama khyang khawhae thawngim üng ka ja khyum khawiki; ami jah hnim vai üng kei naw pi ami thih vaia ka täng khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Sinakok k'uma jah mkhuimkha lü, ami jumeinak ami cehtak vai khawvei ka pawh khawiki. Aktäa ka mlung na uiawng se, pe kcea ka mlüha vekie pi ka jah mkhuimkha khaia ka cit hü khawiki.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh naw a ngthunghlainaka mawng a pyen </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ngs 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Ahina phäh vaia Ktaiyü ngvaiea vei ana yah lü Damatet mlüha ka citki.<verse eid="ACT 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Sangpuxang aw, ka ceh mhnüp nglunga kyaki, ka jah cehpüia khyange ja kei pei cu nghngi kthaka vaiki akvai cun khan üngkhyüh vai lawki ka hmuh.<verse eid="ACT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Kami van mdek üng kyu u ngüse, Hebru am, ‘Sawluh, Sawluh, i vai na na mkhuimkhaki ni? Se naw a mahpaa kcung a leha mäiha i vai namät naw namät na pawhki ni?’ tia, kthai ka ngjak.<verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>‘Bawipa aw, nang u ni?’ ka ti. Acunüng, Bawipa naw, ‘Kei Jesuh, na mkhuimkhaa ka kyaki.<verse eid="ACT 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Acunsepi, tho law lü; na khaw am ngdüi lawa. Ka ning mpya vaia na veia tuhngawi ka ngdang lawki. Nang naw tungawi na h<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cangcim avang üng am ve</char><char style="fq" closed="false">keia phäh.</char></note>mu cun jah mtheh lü malama i ka ning mhnuh khai ti cun ka pyen khai.<verse eid="ACT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Isarel khyange naküt ja Khyangmjükceea kut üngka naw ka ning yung khai; ami mik na ja mdeisak khaia, ami veia ning tüih veng.<verse eid="ACT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Ami mik jah mdeisak lü, nghmüp üngka naw akvaia na jah nghlatsak khaia khawyama johit üngka naw Mhnama veia ja nghlatsak lü, kei ami na jumeinak am ami mkhyekatnake jah mhläta lü Pamhnama xüe khyange am atänga hnün ami yah vaia ni’ a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh naw a Khutbi a jah mtheh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Acunakyase, sangpuxang Akipah aw, khankhawa ka, ngdannak cun am kcanga veng. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Ngs 9:20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref></char></note>Akcüka Damatet ja Jerusalema kaea veia, Judah pe naküta kaea veia, khyangmjükcee veia pi, ngjutnaka nglawia bi bi u lü, ngjut u lü Pamhnama veia ami nghlat lawnak vaia, ka jah mthehki ni.<verse eid="ACT 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Ahina phäha ni, Judahe naw temple k'uma na man u lü, ami na hnim hlü.<verse eid="ACT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnama na yungnaka phäha tuhngawi cäpa, hin üng adik ja akdämea veia ka saksi pyen veng. I pyen akcea am kya sahmae ja Mosi naw ami na pyen cun küm law khai ti cun ni ka jah ksinghüsak,<verse eid="ACT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Kor 15:20</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Hesa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char>
    </note>Mesijah cun mkhuimkhanak khamei lü, thihnak üngka naw akcüka tho beki tia küikyannaka mawng cun khyangmjükcee jah Judahe veia ka sangki,” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Acukba Pawluh naw a ngsungkhameinak pyen lü, Festuh angsanga ngpyang lü, “Pawluh aw, ang veki; na ngtheingkhawng khawha naw ning yusak ve” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh naw, “Akhlüngtai, Festuh aw, am ang veng; ngthu kcang ka pyenki ni.<verse eid="ACT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Sangpuxang Akipah aw! Hina ngthu avan na ksingkia kyase na veia ling lü ka pyen theiki. Hina mawng avan na süm khaia ka ngaiki. I pi thup vai am ve ti cun pi na ksingki.<verse eid="ACT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Sangpuxang Akipah aw, sahmaea na jah jumki aw? Na jumkia ka ksingki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Akipah naw Pawluh üng, “Asängca üng Khritjana ka thawn khaia na ngaiki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pawluh naw, “Asänga pi kyase, khawveia pi kyase, nang däka am kyakia, tuhngawi ka pyen ngjaki naküt pi, keia kba ami ve law hnga vaia, mthiyüi am khun käh nikia, Pamhnama veia ka ktaiyüki ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Sangpuxang, pe uki, Berani ja ami peia ngawhkie ngdüi law u lü;<verse eid="ACT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>a jah cehtak käna, “Hina khyang hin hnim vai ja thawngim üng kyum vaia i pi am pawh” tia ngthähki he.<verse eid="ACT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Acunüng, Akipah naw Festuh üng, “Hina khyang naw Romah Emperoa veia a pha vaia am a ngtänga ta hlät vai sü” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Pawluh mlawng am Romaha citki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Italia mlawng am ceh vai ami mkhyah law ja Pawluh ja thawng kyum avange cun Julijah ngmingnaki, Romah yekap üngka ngvai üng a jah mhjum, “Acun cun sangpuxang yekappä ngvai ami ti.”<verse eid="ACT 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Adramutiha mlawng üngka naw, Asah hne üngka tui pei üngkhyüh ngtünei lü athuknaka kami ciki. Maketawnih hnea ka Aristakhas, Thesalonikah mlüh üngka kami hlawnga veki.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Angawi üng, Sidon kami phaki. Julijah naw Pawluh mceh na lü a khyah, a püiea veia cit se a püie naw hlükawki ami pet vaia a cehsak.<verse eid="ACT 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Acun üngka naw, tui üng kami cit beki, khawkhi naw akceha jah cehsak se, Kuparuh kyawn da kami citki. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Kilikiha ja Pampuliha pei tui kami khe käna, Lukia hne, Muraha kami phaki. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Acua yekap ngvai naw Aleksandria üngkhyüh Itali cit khai mlawng hmu lü; a jah ngcumsak.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Mhnüp khawvei angpäicaa cit u lü akpäihnaka Kanidah mlüh kami phaki. Khawkhi am daw se, Karet kyawn cit lü Kep Salmonih ami ti khe lü kami citkie.<verse eid="ACT 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Va thäihca u lü, Laseah mlüh üngkhyüh am thuki Sep Habar ami tia hnün anänga kami pha lawki.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Mhnüp khawvei sumei lü, mlawng am msu lü ceh vai a kyühksea phäha, Thawngnaka Mhnüp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Thawngnak Mhnüp: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khaw am daw üngta cehcawn hü khakia kyase Setinper khya a päih üng, am ani üng Oktoper khya kcük üng ami bilawh yah.</char></note> pi a khe päng. Pawluh naw jah mcäi lü,<verse eid="ACT 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>“Khyange aw, atuh mlawng am mi cehta, mlawng ja khawhthem he ami khyüh päih däka am kya lü, mi xünnak pi khyük khaia hmu veng” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Acunsepi, yekap ngvai naw Pawluha pyen am kcang na lü keptin ja mlawng maha pyen a jah kcangnak.<verse eid="ACT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Acuna tui kam cun khawksik khya üng venaka am daw se, cit be tü u lü, Phonenih pha vaia kami kthanaki, a thawn khawh ta acua khawksik khya kami sumei khai kami ngtängki. Phonenih tui pei cun Kareta ve lü, nghngi kyak ja cuma keh, nghngi kyak ja sipa keh da pi kyase ma na hüki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nghngi kyak ja cuma keh</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">nghngi kyak ja sipa keh.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpanglai khana Khawkhikse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Khet da khawkhi nghäi ngtün lü khi law se, khyange naw ami ngaia kba thawn khaia ngai u lü, kpunnak yüi kaih lü Karet tui kam da citkie.<verse eid="ACT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Acunsepi, asäng üng, Püi Khawkhi ami tia khawkhi cun kyawn da aktäa khi lawki.<verse eid="ACT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Mlawng a cut law üng, mlawng naw khawkhi am näng se, kami ktha päih lü khawa a khinak da a jah ceh hüpüi.<verse eid="ACT 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Kaladeh ngming nakia kyawna kami ngtunjinnak vai kami hmuki. Mlawng käh a pyak vaia ngyan üng kami pawhki.<verse eid="ACT 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Mlawng cun jän kaihca lü khäng khaia yüi am ami kphung. Acunüng Libya kawnga khana a ngtaih vai kyüh u lü, jih ja nemsak lü khawkhia a jah cehnak püia kami citki.<verse eid="ACT 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Angawi üng khawkhikse khi law se, mlawng üngka phüie cun tui üng ami ja tawn.<verse eid="ACT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>A ngawi be tü üng, ami naw mlawng üngka phüie cun ami jah tawn be tü.<verse eid="ACT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Khaw mhnüp khawvei nghngi ja aisie pi käh ngdang lü khawkhi naw jah mnawk hü se, kami lät khai pi am kami ngai tiki.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Khawvei ei kaa kami ve käna, Pawluh ami ksunga ngdüi lawki naw, “Khyange aw, asüa, ka pyen ngai u lü, Karet üngka naw käh mi lawa ta, ahikba pyaknak ja sungpyamnak am mi khamei khai sü.<verse eid="ACT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Acunsepi, atuh ning jah nghui na veng, ling u lü ve u, mlawng däk khyük lü, nami xünnak am khyük, a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Isetiakyaküng, tuh mthana, ka jumei ja ka hjawkhah, Pamhnama khankhawngsä mat ka veia law lü,<verse eid="ACT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‘Pawluh aw, käh cäia! Empero Sangpuxanga hmaia na ngdüi khai, Pamhnama dawkyanak naw na jah ngkhapkie sak cän jah mpyenei ve.’<verse eid="ACT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Acunakyase, khyange aw, ling ua, a na mtheha mäiha kya khai tia Pamhnam ka jumki.<verse eid="ACT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Acunsepi, tui kam mat mata mi ngtaih khaie” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Acunüng, mthan xaleikphyü üng, Adih Mpanglaituia khawkhikse naw a jah mnawk hü. Mthan nglunga yekape naw keimi cun kawng da kami ng’et lawki tia cam hü u lü ami ksing law.<verse eid="ACT 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Acunüng, tuia a thuk cam tü se, lam mku lawkia ami ksing. Asäng nghjawk se ami cam be üng, lam xaleimhma law se ami ksing.<verse eid="ACT 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Lung a suk vai kyühei u lü, mlawnga ngmei da mthimhjum phyü ju khya u lü, khawa thaih law hlah vaia kami ktaiyükie.<verse eid="ACT 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Mlawng mawngkie naw, mlawng cun centak vaia ngtäng u lü mlawnga ma mthimhjum khyakia ngsaih u lü mlawngca cun tui üng ami ju khyak.<verse eid="ACT 27:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Acun ja, Pawluh naw yekap ngvai ja yekapea veia, “Mlawng mawngkie mlawnga khana am nami ve ta am lät uki” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Yekape naw, mlawngca khihnaka yüie cun, jah cap pat lü, mlawngca cun ami khyah.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Khawthaih law hlü ja Pawluh naw, ami van naw ei ami ei vaia a jah nghuinak. “Tungawi, mhnüp xaleikphyü law pängki, i am ei u lü ei kaa nami veki.<verse eid="ACT 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Acunakyase, ning jah nghui na veng, nami xün vaia i mä ei ua. Nami lusam matca pi am khyük khai ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Acun a pyen law päng üng, Pawluh naw muk lo lü, Pamhnama veia jenak mtheh lü khyangea hmaia; mu cun boki lü a ei. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Ami vana cäicingnak dim law lü ami ei pi ei law hngakie. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Acuna khyange cun phya nghngih ja khyühkip ja khyuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phya nghngih ja khyühkip ja kyuk; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cangcim avang üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phya nghngih ja khyühkipa mhma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akce üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyühkip ja khyuk bang.</char></note> mlawnga khana veki.<verse eid="ACT 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Avan naw kami ei law käna, mlawng hang khaia kyung cun mpanglai üng kami jah tawn.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ami Mlawnga seta mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Khawa thaih law üng, acuna kawng cun mlawng mawnge naw am ksing u, lüpi tuikam cun ksing u lü mlawng cun acua ngdüi khaia ami pawh vaia ngtün lawki he.<verse eid="ACT 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Acunüng, mthimhjum ja mawngnak ami jah kunnak yüi cun ja mawi pat u lü, tui üng ami mcum. Acun kung üng, jih ja khihnaka yüie cun ja kphyawtkie naw, a ma lama jinu cun khawkhi naw a hmut vaia häi u lü tuikam da citkie.<verse eid="ACT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Acunsepi, mlawng naw mdih su se, mlawnga lu da cun ngtangei lawki, mlawnga ngmei da cun tuiyüi a kyan lawa phäha pyakeiki.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Yekape naw thawng kyume cun tui jawh u lü ami cen vai kyühkie naw jah hnim vaia ami bü law.<verse eid="ACT 27:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Acunsepi, yekap ngvai naw Pawluh a yun vai täng lü, acun ami hnim vaia ami tün cun a jah mkhyawh. Tui jawh theiki naküt cun tui üng kco u lü, kawng da ami jawh ma vaia, <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>avange cun, thing pheka khana, avang mlawnga mtimteea khana pek law khaiea a jah mtheh. Acunüng, kami van kawnga phyawn lü kami pek päihkie.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Malitah mlüha pekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Tui pei cun akdima kami pek käna, khaw kawng cun Malitah ngming nakia kami ksing law.<verse eid="ACT 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Khaw a lü, khaw sik se, acuna khyang jah mhlänakie. Khaw a lü khaw sik se, khawmahe naw mei tik u lü kami van jah na dokie.<verse eid="ACT 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Pawluh naw thing pawk mkhäm lü, mei am a tih üng ngling law se, kphyu lut lawki naw, a kut cui lü a ven law.<verse eid="ACT 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Khyange naw, kphyu cun hmu u lü, “Hina khyang hin, khyang hnimkia kya kung ve, tui üng lät sepi, Phu sui beki naw a xüng vai am ti ve” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Acunsepi, Pawluh ia am thawn lü kphyu cun mei üng a khyak.<verse eid="ACT 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Amimi naw cun, a pumsa hngawh ta ngphyüng law se, thi lü kyu law khaia ami ngai; acunüng pi khawvei ami k’ä ih käna ia pi am veki tia ami ksing üng, ami mlung nglat se, “mhnama kya ve” ami ti law.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Acuna hnün peia, acuna lai ka nakia ngvai säih, Puhbalih ngming naki naw ja je na lü, mhnüp kthum a ja khinnak.<verse eid="ACT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Acua Puhbaliha pa mhnatei lü a khawn pi msawi se a ihnaka veki. Pawluh a veia lut lü, a khana a kut mtaihki naw, ktaiyü pe se mya be.<verse eid="ACT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Acukba a thawn law ja, acuna kyawn üngka khyange am myaki law u se a jah mdaw be.<verse eid="ACT 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Acunee naw, aktäa letsawng ami jah pet; mlawnga khana kami hlükaw naküt cun ami jah pet.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malitah üngkhyüh Romaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Khya kthum Aleksandria mlüh üngkhyüh mlawng “Mhnam Ngphi” ngming naki am kami ceh käna, khawsik khyaa kyase Malta kami awmki.<verse eid="ACT 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Sarakuh mlüha pha u lü, acua mhnüp kthum kami awmki.<verse eid="ACT 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Acuna mlüh üngka naw cit u lü Rekon mlüh kami phaki. Angawi üng, cum khawkhi law se, mhnüp nghngihnak üng Pawtajolih mlüh kami phaki.<verse eid="ACT 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Acua jumeikie jah hmu u lü, ami veia mhnüp khyüh kami ve khaw ami jah nghuinak. Acukba cu Romah mlüh da kami lawki.<verse eid="ACT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Romaha veki jumeikie naw kami mawng ksing u se, acun üngka naw, Apijah jawihtuknaka hnüna khyüh thukia law u lü, khina kainak hnün kthuma venak cäpa jah na do lawki he. Pawluh naw jah hmu se Pamhnam je na lü a ktha ve lawki.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Romaha Pawluha mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Romaha kami pha üng, Pawluh cun yekap mat naw k'äih lü amät ami vesak.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Amhnüp kthum käna Pawluh naw, ngnama Judah ngvaie cun jah khü lü ngkhyumkie. Ami ngkhäm law üng Pawluh naw ami veia, “Ka püi Isarele aw, mi khyange ja mi pupaea thum am ka jah lümkanki, cunsepi, thawng üng na khyum u lü Jerusalem üngka naw Romahe kut üng ami na mhjum ni.<verse eid="ACT 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Romah khyange naw na kthäh u lü, thihnak vai hlawka ka bilawh i am hmu u se, ami na hlät be vai ami täng kyaw.<verse eid="ACT 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 25:11">Ngs 25:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cunsepi, Judah khyange naw am täng u lü, Empero Sangpuxanga veia ka ngdang khaia amthuia ami na pawh. Ka khyange cun am jah mkatei veng.<verse eid="ACT 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Acunakyase, nangmi ning ja hmu lü, nami veia ngthueipüi vaia ka ning jah khü ni. Isarele naw ami äpei khyanga phäh kei hin mthiyüi am ami khih ni” a ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Amimi naw a veia, “Na mawngma Judah hne üngka naw ca am ami yahki, mi khyang u pi hia law lü na khana am dawki mawng cun pi am pyen law u.<verse eid="ACT 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Acunsepi, na ngpüinak mawng cun hnün naküta khyange naw ksekhanakie kyase na cungaih cun keimi naw pi kami ngai hlükie ni” ami ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Acunüng khaw mhnüp tamkie. Acuna mhnüp a pha law üng Pawluh venak ima khyang khawha lawki he. Angawi lam üngkhyü tünei lü mü vei cäpa Pamhnama khyawng pe cun Mosia Thum ja sahmaea yuknak üngka Jesuha mawng khe lü khyange cun a jah ksingsak vaia jah mthehki.<verse eid="ACT 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Avang naw a ngthu pyen jum u se, avange naw am jum u.<verse eid="ACT 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Acunüng, käh ngkhawt law u se, Pawluh naw ngthu mat a pyen käna cit bekie. A ngthu pyen cun hina kyaki; “Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw sahma Hesajah üngkhyüh nami pupae veia a pyen hin ihlawka cangki ni,<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26,27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Hesa 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>‘Hina khyangea veia cit lü va pyena, akcanga nami ngai khai, acunsepi a suilam am ksing u. Akcanga bükteng u lü pi, am hmuh thei u,<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>‘isetiakyaküng ami mlung nghmüp lü ami nghnga pi kdenkie lü ami mik pi kbawmkie. Acukba käh thawn lü ami mik naw hmu lü ami nghnga naw pi ngjak khai kyaw. Ami mlung pi ksing u lü kei da nglat law lü ka jah myasak khai ti lü Pamhnam naw a ti.”<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnama küikyannaka ngthu cun Khyangmjükceea veia jah tha lü ami naw cungai khaie” akpäihnak a ti. <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Acuna ngthu a pyen päng ja, Judahe amimät naw ngcuh u lü cit bekie.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Pawluh cun kum nghngih acua amät im ngvat lü, a veia lawki he naküt cun akdawa jah dokhamki.<verse eid="ACT 28:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Pamhnama khyawngpe ja Bawia Jesuh Khritawa mawng cun lingnak am sangkhapki.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
